g samurai who stray into their swamp, then selling whatever valuables they find. Both are devastated when they learn that Kichi has died, but his wife soon begins an affair with a neighbor who survived the war, Hachi. The mother disapproves and, when she can''t steal Hachi for herself, tries to scare her daughter-in-law with a mysterious mask from a dead samurai.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"1964-11-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AcAMkNfQ21cL7EJzs5eVx24k3H4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xyPLG53OodhJtvfQEfcmC43l16O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AcAMkNfQ21cL7EJzs5eVx24k3H4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xyPLG53OodhJtvfQEfcmC43l16O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":675,"title":"Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix","description":"When a new professor''s methods leave Hogwarts unprepared to fight the rising tide of evil, Harry teaches students how to defend against the dark arts.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2007-07-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9svsJni0pNROt53QBEj9JqZMuEK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5aOyriWkPec0zUDxmHFP9qMmBaj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9svsJni0pNROt53QBEj9JqZMuEK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5aOyriWkPec0zUDxmHFP9qMmBaj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":539517,"title":"Constantine: City of Demons - The Movie","description":"A decade after a tragic mistake, family man Chas Chandler and occult detective John Constantine set out to cure his daughter Trish from a mysterious supernatural coma.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Fantasy","Animation","Horror","Action"],"release_date":"2018-10-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dPPjBf74W1j8va6KvDGePaJcqm7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tZIMe2p