ion":"Tim and John fell in love while teenagers at their all-boys high school. John was captain of the football team, Tim an aspiring actor playing a minor part in Romeo and Juliet. Their romance endured for 15 years in the face of everything life threw at it – the separations, the discrimination, the temptations, the jealousies and the losses – until the only problem that love can''t solve tried to destroy them.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-08-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/geJLQjNXuLhEz5Nr8bTOBIUAn2G.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dF04CHO27xbNL0Zn0JJ0QdC7SNU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//geJLQjNXuLhEz5Nr8bTOBIUAn2G.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dF04CHO27xbNL0Zn0JJ0QdC7SNU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":68053,"title":"Slap the Monster on Page One","description":"Days before the general election, after a girl from a rich family is murdered in an attempted rape, the editor-in-chief of a conservative tabloid tries to derail the police investigation in order to help the right-wing candidates supported by his bosses.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1972-10-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3OsXhM3WJJKTk77a2RttvP042jp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lpbmcbPcL7Bj8VTimnSt5uuG6C3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3OsXhM3WJJKTk77a2RttvP042jp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lpbmcbPcL7Bj8VTimnSt5uuG6C3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":656563,"title":"Rich in Love","description":"Working incognito at his rich dad''s company to test his own merits, Teto falls for Paula and tells her he grew up poor, a lie that spins out of control.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-04-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eVFfdrBbDX1B3y1yIxoRjrGM