no himself. If Kuai Liang cannot break through the glacier of doubt that holds him back, Earthrealm will fall.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2022-10-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/endVnEgUGjibpLaF0yjUX2CWhh4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8wyOdQRVrpoUb2wMdGHykaD17GM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//endVnEgUGjibpLaF0yjUX2CWhh4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8wyOdQRVrpoUb2wMdGHykaD17GM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":65592,"title":"Princes and Princesses","description":"In this episodic animated fantasy from France, an art teacher interprets a series of six fairy tales (each involving a prince or princess) with the help of two precocious students. Princes and Princesses was created using a special style of cutout animation, with black silhouetted characters performing the action against backlit backdrops in striking colors.","duration":"1:10:00","genre":["Drama","Animation","Fantasy","Comedy","Family","Romance","Mystery","Adventure"],"release_date":"2000-01-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6W2jH4hcqbNto9uTyda8ccNj1oJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gP1PDJmbsF5J2teuond2OtRiEaC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6W2jH4hcqbNto9uTyda8ccNj1oJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gP1PDJmbsF5J2teuond2OtRiEaC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4497,"title":"Viridiana","description":"Viridiana is preparing to start her life as a nun when she is sent, somewhat unwillingly, to visit her aging uncle, Don Jaime. He supports her; but the two have met only once. Jaime thinks Viridiana resembles his dead wife. Viridiana has secretly despised this man all her life and finds her worst fears proven when Jaime grows determined to seduce his pure niece. Viridiana becomes undone as her uncle upends the plans she had made to join the convent.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1962-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2QGuTuyxwCCER9iwSeONW8BAxce.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mYPuSx5JwL8AdTwS1iQW4Un1cYP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2QGuTuyxwCCER9iwSeONW8BAxce.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mYPuSx5JwL8AdTwS1iQW4Un1cYP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14580,"title":"The Big Heat","description":"After the suspicious suicide of a fellow cop, tough homicide detective Dave Bannion takes the law into his own hands when he sets out to smash a vicious crime syndicate.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1953-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aqZookq6pJmIT9lVIjDsBY2MNpK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ezt6fb4JbghGKmaMzzuMtxpz0Kb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aqZookq6pJmIT9lVIjDsBY2MNpK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ezt6fb4JbghGKmaMzzuMtxpz0Kb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":597316,"title":"My Little Pony: A New Generation","description":"Equestria''s divided. But a bright-eyed hero believes Earth Ponies, Pegasi and Unicorns should be pals — and, hoof to heart, she’s determined to prove it.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ugukqzx4gSzBd1yzmbWEHLkpGaS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uvbj8puRj37Pc8FS4rIfVeReYFF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ugukqzx4gSzBd1yzmbWEHLkpGaS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uvbj8puRj37Pc8FS4rIfVeReYFF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22881,"title":"The Blind Side","description":"The story of Michael Oher, a homeless and traumatized boy who became an All American football player and first round NFL draft pick with the help of a caring woman and her family.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2009-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5P6hWD4zxAMntRuRnB4MmPLijNw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/PhpAdRopu0sOWf0BY7vVtxrRD3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5P6hWD4zxAMntRuRnB4MmPLijNw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//PhpAdRopu0sOWf0BY7vVtxrRD3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1592,"title":"Primal Fear","description":"Defense attorney Martin Vail takes on jobs for money and prestige rather than any sense of the greater good. His latest case involves an altar boy, accused of brutally murdering the archbishop of Chicago. Vail finds himself up against his ex-pupil and ex-lover, but as the case progresses and the Church''s dark secrets are revealed, Vail finds that what appeared a simple case takes on a darker, more dangerous aspect.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1996-04-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dZM71rHXh3Oo3WZlw8YpMMsoVB5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qJf2TzE8nRTFbFMPJNW6c8mI0KU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dZM71rHXh3Oo3WZlw8YpMMsoVB5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qJf2TzE8nRTFbFMPJNW6c8mI0KU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":499,"title":"Cléo from 5 to 7","description":"Agnès Varda eloquently captures Paris in the sixties with this real-time portrait of a singer set adrift in the city as she awaits test results of a biopsy. A chronicle of the minutes of one woman’s life, Cléo from 5 to 7 is a spirited mix of vivid vérité and melodrama, featuring a score by Michel Legrand and cameos by Jean-Luc Godard and Anna Karina.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1962-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oyatchDPpS4I9jpIIezFJGrmXcR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oelBStY4xpguaplRv15P3Za7Xsr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oyatchDPpS4I9jpIIezFJGrmXcR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oelBStY4xpguaplRv15P3Za7Xsr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":522627,"title":"The Gentlemen","description":"American expat Mickey Pearson has built a highly profitable marijuana empire in London. When word gets out that he’s looking to cash out of the business forever it triggers plots, schemes, bribery and blackmail in an attempt to steal his domain out from under him.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"2020-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hClLP88yMIuhslwSVxtYrvWmxfp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jtrhTYB7xSrJxR1vusu99nvnZ1g.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hClLP88yMIuhslwSVxtYrvWmxfp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jtrhTYB7xSrJxR1vusu99nvnZ1g.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10971,"title":"A Night to Remember","description":"The sinking of the Titanic is presented in a highly realistic fashion in this tense British drama. The disaster is portrayed largely from the perspective of the ocean liner''s second officer, Charles Lightoller. Despite numerous warnings about ice, the ship sails on, with Capt. Edward John Smith keeping it going at a steady clip. When the doomed vessel finally hits an iceberg, the crew and passengers discover that they lack enough lifeboats, and tragedy follows.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama","Action","History"],"release_date":"1958-07-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gHWnnV2n9eS1aQKRmg6JSpj6bsC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6fDhJAz6AuYWj3hAnvUL42Xlxfj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gHWnnV2n9eS1aQKRmg6JSpj6bsC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6fDhJAz6AuYWj3hAnvUL42Xlxfj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2433,"title":"The Young Girls of Rochefort","description":"In the seaside town of Rochefort, twin sisters Delphine and Solange dream of love and artistic fulfillment beyond their quiet lives. As sailors, artists, musicians, and chance visitors pass through town during a weekend fair, a web of near-misses and romantic longing brings ideal partners tantalizingly close—without their realizing it.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1967-03-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8m7qOKlsdnxt4335vpFzpffuIVu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jtxhyGaYhurH6KsjvP1jV3dDypz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8m7qOKlsdnxt4335vpFzpffuIVu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jtxhyGaYhurH6KsjvP1jV3dDypz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":845,"title":"Strangers on a Train","description":"A charming psychopath tries to coerce a tennis star into his theory that two strangers can commit the perfect crime by exchanging murders—each killing the other’s most-hated person.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1951-06-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8Tnn2UOlecCKNLKG8ZK5Mu6bK94.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ihC083U7ef56Ui4x0P0dobojrZ1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8Tnn2UOlecCKNLKG8ZK5Mu6bK94.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ihC083U7ef56Ui4x0P0dobojrZ1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":227932,"title":"My Mom Is a Character 2","description":"Dona Hermínia is back, but now rich and famous since she is the host of her own successful TV show. However, the overprotective character will have to deal with her children''s departures, as Marcelina and Juliano decide to move out. In counterpart, she will welcome, as a visitor, her sister Lúcia Helena, who''s been living in New York.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qW5LsOjND9IqkySlFlsixO9hlAQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eDApDWU6r9zxk9MZLc6rfnBb3vu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qW5LsOjND9IqkySlFlsixO9hlAQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eDApDWU6r9zxk9MZLc6rfnBb3vu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":891,"title":"All the President''s Men","description":"During the 1972 elections, two reporters'' investigation sheds light on the controversial Watergate scandal that compels President Nixon to resign from his post.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1976-04-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aAMn59bq6DZQtWoYqsIOUkVWSgc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pCe6lfLxt1B58zPD4lgQrlnDS2j.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aAMn59bq6DZQtWoYqsIOUkVWSgc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pCe6lfLxt1B58zPD4lgQrlnDS2j.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":812,"title":"Aladdin","description":"In the boorish city of Agrabah, kind-hearted street urchin Aladdin and Princess Jasmine fall in love, although she can only marry a prince. He and power-hungry Grand Vizier Jafar vie for a magic lamp that can fulfill their wishes.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Adventure","Fantasy","Romance"],"release_date":"1992-11-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nenJjvfe2Eq8uBMXFJnWj5mw4bi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eLFfl7vS8dkeG1hKp5mwbm37V83.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nenJjvfe2Eq8uBMXFJnWj5mw4bi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eLFfl7vS8dkeG1hKp5mwbm37V83.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":980026,"title":"The Promised Land","description":"Denmark, 1755. Captain Ludvig Kahlen sets out to conquer a Danish heath 