y-to-day life through a recurring daydream of himself as a virtuous hero saving a beautiful damsel. Investigating a case that led to the wrongful arrest and eventual death of an innocent man instead of wanted terrorist Harry Tuttle, he meets the woman from his daydream, and in trying to help her gets caught in a web of mistaken identities, mindless bureaucracy and lies.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1985-02-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9IYyCLf5NNAQFK9pNtqzEU9HWzM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2w09J0KUnVtJvqPYu8N63XjAyCR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9IYyCLf5NNAQFK9pNtqzEU9HWzM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2w09J0KUnVtJvqPYu8N63XjAyCR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":128246,"title":"A Werewolf Boy","description":"An unexpected phone call brings an elderly woman to her childhood country cottage, and memories of an orphan boy she knew 47 years ago come flooding back to her.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8wKDBmmSoLRMtf42dhu7uUDKS1c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r8nLI2052swGQ53p5eVVPuEzlAf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8wKDBmmSoLRMtf42dhu7uUDKS1c.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r8nLI2052swGQ53p5eVVPuEzlAf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16219,"title":"Gladiator","description":"Tommy Riley has moved with his dad to Chicago from a ''nice place''. He keeps to himself, goes to school. However, after a street fight, he''s noticed and quickly falls into the world of illegal underground boxing — where punches can kill.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1992-03-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rE3t6AnaTWzX1i02ntO3jwrWIts.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and