orted by Maimouna, her best friend, she decides to follow in the footsteps of Rebecca, a respected dealer. But her encounter with Djigui, a young, disturbingly sensual dancer, throws her off course.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2016-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3uIHgW5SAaa8kP24aoFvgf9hjOX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gOwIZPNFstt9BWUyekMzSF2Wzd1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3uIHgW5SAaa8kP24aoFvgf9hjOX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gOwIZPNFstt9BWUyekMzSF2Wzd1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":313297,"title":"Kubo and the Two Strings","description":"Kubo mesmerizes the people in his village with his magical gift for spinning wild tales with origami. When he accidentally summons an evil spirit seeking vengeance, Kubo is forced to go on a quest to solve the mystery of his fallen samurai father and his mystical weaponry, as well as discover his own magical powers.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"2016-08-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bhspYsRMHgMqzUlxiVpIY8OrqMt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/la6QA9tk4Foq8OBH2Dyh5dTcw6H.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bhspYsRMHgMqzUlxiVpIY8OrqMt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//la6QA9tk4Foq8OBH2Dyh5dTcw6H.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":55,"title":"Amores Perros","description":"A fatalistic car crash in Mexico city sets off a chain of events in the lives of three people: a supermodel, a young man wanting to run off with his sister-in-law, and a homeless man.","duration":"2:34:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iTkxwBriD9YKg4Q35qWEIlLXd6e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1lX74fPZsBoOyyE5fWL5xT7k9sV.jpg","small_backdro