en danger threatens her camp, the fierce and highly skilled Comanche warrior Naru sets out to protect her people. But the prey she stalks turns out to be a highly evolved alien predator with a technically advanced arsenal.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Thriller","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2022-08-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7ZO9yoEU2fAHKhmJWfAc2QIPWJg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2FKjLRt7oK1bRRIrxgWmthbBdFh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7ZO9yoEU2fAHKhmJWfAc2QIPWJg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2FKjLRt7oK1bRRIrxgWmthbBdFh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":137113,"title":"Edge of Tomorrow","description":"Major Bill Cage is an officer who has never seen a day of combat when he is unceremoniously demoted and dropped into combat. Cage is killed within minutes, managing to take an alpha alien down with him. He awakens back at the beginning of the same day and is forced to fight and die again... and again - as physical contact with the alien has thrown him into a time loop.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2014-05-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4V1yIoAKPMRQwGBaSses8Bp2nsi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nBM9MMa2WCwvMG4IJ3eiGUdbPe6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4V1yIoAKPMRQwGBaSses8Bp2nsi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nBM9MMa2WCwvMG4IJ3eiGUdbPe6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":127501,"title":"Barfi!","description":"The heartwarming tale of Barfi, a charming deaf-mute young man from 1970s Darjeeling, and two unalike women who can''t help but fall for him.","duration":"2:31:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"2012-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lnNEmbGoxcSoO69NeavliNUxT3O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_