y to change this apocalyptic future","duration":"0:48:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1993-02-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o72nw4sK9dmle0bGpHoTIvR5N5y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AfUkiiR0UKeiPXPgTx9bRO4snTB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o72nw4sK9dmle0bGpHoTIvR5N5y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AfUkiiR0UKeiPXPgTx9bRO4snTB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":886396,"title":"Batman and Superman: Battle of the Super Sons","description":"After discovering he has powers, 11-year-old Jonathan Kent and assassin-turned-Boy-Wonder Damian Wayne must join forces to rescue their fathers (Superman & Batman) and save the planet from the malevolent alien force known as Starro.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2022-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iQJ1gC2p6yn5wnBEklhPaEFJ3n1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mvffaexT5kA3chOnGxwBSlRoshh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iQJ1gC2p6yn5wnBEklhPaEFJ3n1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mvffaexT5kA3chOnGxwBSlRoshh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":381289,"title":"A Dog''s Purpose","description":"A dog goes on quest to discover his purpose in life over the course of several lifetimes with multiple owners.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-01-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sLjeApi5odpyEoCzAnbr5DycL3z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3jcNvhtVQe5Neoffdic39fRactM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sLjeApi5odpyEoCzAnbr5DycL3z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3jcNvhtVQe5Neoffdic39fRactM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":371645,"title":"Hunt for the Wilderpeople","description":"Ricky is a defiant young city kid who finds himself on the run with his cantankerous foster uncle in the wild New Zealand bush. A national manhunt ensues, and the two are forced to put aside their differences and work together to survive.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-01-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ixpUtvrZNwk6LBObXaNH8fh4FYf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hkmz9rxgcweizXNElozGeKwmAJE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ixpUtvrZNwk6LBObXaNH8fh4FYf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hkmz9rxgcweizXNElozGeKwmAJE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19101,"title":"A Little Princess","description":"When her father enlists to fight for the British in WWI, young Sara Crewe goes to New York to attend the same boarding school her late mother attended. She soon clashes with the severe headmistress, Miss Minchin, who attempts to stifle Sara''s creativity and sense of self-worth.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1995-05-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tcMVpjdEpsXrbPtVrSmh4uDBSiy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9V4bAVEskSNbEqjVI0YmeuB0n8I.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tcMVpjdEpsXrbPtVrSmh4uDBSiy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9V4bAVEskSNbEqjVI0YmeuB0n8I.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15251,"title":"Eddie Murphy: Delirious","description":"Taped live and in concert at Constitution Hall in Washington, D.C. in August, 1983, Eddie Murphy: Delirious captures Eddie Murphy''s wild and outrageous stand-up comedy act, which he performed in New York and eighteen other cities across the U.S. to standing-room-only audiences. Eddie''s comedy was groundbreaking, completely new, razor sharp and definitely funny.Eddie Murphy pontificates in his own vulgarly hilarious fashion on everything from bizarre sexual fantasies to reliving the family barbecue, and is peppered with Eddie''s one-of-a-kind wit. Laugh along as Eddie reminiscences of hot childhood days and the ice cream man intermixed with classic vocal parodies of top American entertainers.Experience Eddie Murphy at his best, live and red hot! Delirious! Uncensored and Uncut!","duration":"1:09:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1983-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7STCwOwwe4bwZsuGHhyUQ8if2jl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qnNXoflFXeUg692kulMKVJVRzYf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7STCwOwwe4bwZsuGHhyUQ8if2jl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qnNXoflFXeUg692kulMKVJVRzYf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":61202,"title":"Zindagi Na Milegi Dobara","description":"Three friends who were inseparable in childhood decide to go on a three-week-long bachelor road trip to Spain, in order to re-establish their bond and explore thrilling adventures, before one of them gets married. What will they learn of themselves and each other during the adventure?","duration":"2:34:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2011-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z4k7b66jAHP8sQbEahxss6Ct8BW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hKO9O715wYxjkQSEv47giCYcyO8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z4k7b66jAHP8sQbEahxss6Ct8BW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hKO9O715wYxjkQSEv47giCYcyO8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36265,"title":"Simon of the Desert","description":"Simon, a deeply religious man living in the 4th century, wants to be nearer to God so he climbs a column. The Devil wants him come down to Earth and is trying to seduce him.","duration":"0:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1965-08-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sm7NapjwKYhIH2GzFEgJkiw9hF1.jp