h":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iEFuHjqrE059SmflBva1JzDJutE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dQNJ8SdCMn3zWwHzzQD2xrphR1X.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iEFuHjqrE059SmflBva1JzDJutE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dQNJ8SdCMn3zWwHzzQD2xrphR1X.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14784,"title":"The Fall","description":"In a hospital on the outskirts of 1920s Los Angeles, an injured stuntman begins to tell a fellow patient, a little girl with a broken arm, a fantastic story about 5 mythical heroes. Thanks to his fractured state of mind and her vivid imagination, the line between fiction and reality starts to blur as the tale advances.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"2008-01-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vNrXoT45xscHY6AN4IGf44vHxVJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ez7xavvDr5yDz4sSvI55xDp0BoU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vNrXoT45xscHY6AN4IGf44vHxVJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ez7xavvDr5yDz4sSvI55xDp0BoU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13386,"title":"I''m Starting from Three","description":"Gaetano, a young Neapolitan, decides to leave home, work and friends, to look for other moments of life and meet other people.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1981-03-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gL8WqjpbkoOdo1y3qkt4GUkdDhV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lS0X9KScgkUbhiu6lOHBya8z9R2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gL8WqjpbkoOdo1y3qkt4GUkdDhV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lS0X9KScgkUbhiu6lOHBya8z9R2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1678,"title":"Godzilla","description":"Japan is thrown into a panic after several ships are sunk near Odo Island. An expedition to the island led by Dr. Kyohei Yamane soon discover something far more devastating than imagined in the form of a 50 meter tall monster whom the natives call Gojira. Now the monster begins a rampage that threatens to destroy not only Japan, but the rest of the world as well.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Thriller","Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1954-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ub1sIbdSrokPZawY2ljExXZov2j.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2W0Yw0qrgVMgdsSCZRKtfvaAh0i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ub1sIbdSrokPZawY2ljExXZov2j.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2W0Yw0qrgVMgdsSCZRKtfvaAh0i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":863,"title":"Toy Story 2","description":"Andy heads off to Cowboy Camp, leaving his toys to their own devices. Things shift into high gear when an obsessive toy collector named Al McWhiggen, owner of Al''s Toy Barn kidnaps Woody. Andy''s toys mount a daring rescue mission, Buzz Lightyear meets his match and Woody has to decide where he and his heart truly belong.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1999-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nsfVr4QbbunUrHINN9N7JdVAMTf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4rbcp3ng8n1MKHjpeqW0L7Fnpzz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nsfVr4QbbunUrHINN9N7JdVAMTf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4rbcp3ng8n1MKHjpeqW0L7Fnpzz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1212763,"title":"Evil Dead Burn","description":"After her husband''s abrupt death, Alice seeks solace with his remaining family — descendants of a leading researcher on demonic possession. As her in-laws transform one by one into creatures that feed on fear, she comes to discover that the vows she took in life survive even in death.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Horror"],"release_date":"2026-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o0jkkpcN81QqSl8DMLScBCXyUH9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uRxrNXQWkHoENm3nwVOZDYSCx2F.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o0jkkpcN81QqSl8DMLScBCXyUH9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uRxrNXQWkHoENm3nwVOZDYSCx2F.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13929,"title":"Geri''s Game","description":"An aging codger named Geri plays a daylong game of chess in the park against himself. Somehow, he begins losing to his livelier opponent. But just when the game''s nearly over, Geri manages to turn the tables.","duration":"0:04:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1997-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3nqjJeI5XVxWayIgoYzrDUCdBZA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8PdCk3T9EkcKniUviDogWFCXx28.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3nqjJeI5XVxWayIgoYzrDUCdBZA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8PdCk3T9EkcKniUviDogWFCXx28.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":572164,"title":"EXIT","description":"At his mother''s 70th birthday party, Yong-nam runs into Eui-joo, who rejected him in college. When the city is engulfed in toxic gas from a terrorist attack, the two must find a way to escape using all the techniques they learned in their college rock climbing club.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-07-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wx9dK8ke3hcC4qBZsovI1SICZl9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zf16eomhCB13cwMb4iFEbBT0Tsr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wx9dK8ke3hcC4qBZsovI1SICZl9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zf16eomhCB13cwMb4iFEbBT0Tsr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":476968,"title":"Paul, Apostle of Christ","description":"Luke risks his life to visit Paul in a Roman prison, where the apostle awaits execution under Nero. As Paul reflects on his past and the Christian community faces persecution, Luke resolves to record the story of the early church.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2018-03-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uk9YSV4GT4iZ9FS5tOJCOmub8GQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2NUXG94dGMKYgJL1BkJGKynMb3l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uk9YSV4GT4iZ9FS5tOJCOmub8GQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2NUXG94dGMKYgJL1BkJGKynMb3l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":74308,"title":"Detachment","description":"A chronicle of three weeks in the lives of several high school teachers, administrators and students through the eyes of substitute teacher, Henry Barthes. Henry roams from school to school, imparting modes of knowledge, but never staying long enough to form any semblance of sentient attachment.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2011-04-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iJwtR94Yq9U83ET0TzirsGWTewH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bC5H2dabnHrQJD1KmQUSUUeuCXU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iJwtR94Yq9U83ET0TzirsGWTewH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bC5H2dabnHrQJD1KmQUSUUeuCXU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":869626,"title":"Marcel the Shell with Shoes On","description":"Marcel is an adorable one-inch-tall shell who ekes out a colorful existence with his grandmother Connie and their pet lint, Alan. Once part of a sprawling community of shells, they now live alone as the sole survivors of a mysterious tragedy. When a documentarian discovers them amongst the clutter of his Airbnb, his resulting short film brings Marcel millions of passionate fans, as well as unprecedented dangers and a new hope at finding his long-lost family.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Drama","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2022-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1PRWW60yQparK1I8Soyy9Evf7Dv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jaYmP4Ct8YLnxWAW2oYkUjeXtzm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1PRWW60yQparK1I8Soyy9Evf7Dv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jaYmP4Ct8YLnxWAW2oYkUjeXtzm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20719,"title":"Day of the Wacko","description":"It is a bitter story about a middle-aged man, who hates his life and other people, including himself. Adam Miauczynski, the character known from director Marek Koterski''s previous films, is a 49 year-old teacher, who reads poetry during school lessons and later goes home swearing and calling his neighbours'' names. The worst pain for him is the next 5 minutes of living. He doesn''t accept himself and even everyday contacts with others cause his aggression. Though constantly dreaming of a romantic love, he is not bold enough to make his dreams come true. The desperate Miauczynski personalizes our own fears and obsessions, which have become so visible recently.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2002-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mE3Z5CkndqNObVwyv6HKMUcz0ow.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2FT8jX2bPHTv8VDC6c4AvBEEq65.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mE3Z5CkndqNObVwyv6HKMUcz0ow.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2FT8jX2bPHTv8VDC6c4AvBEEq65.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13363,"title":"The Man from Earth","description":"A departing professor gathers his closest colleagues for an intimate farewell, but the night takes an unexpected turn when he shares a stunning secret about his past. As the conversation unfolds, skepticism and curiosity collide, challenging everything they thought they knew about history, science, and belief.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-06-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.