o go and see sky lanterns on her eighteenth birthday, but she''s bound to a tower by her overprotective mother. She strikes a deal with Flynn Rider, a charming wanted thief, and the duo set off on an action-packed escapade.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Adventure"],"release_date":"2010-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cWczNud8Y8i8ab0Z4bxos4myWYO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ym7Kst6a4uodryxqbGOxmewF235.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cWczNud8Y8i8ab0Z4bxos4myWYO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ym7Kst6a4uodryxqbGOxmewF235.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13002,"title":"Barbie in the 12 Dancing Princesses","description":"King Randolph sends for his cousin, Duchess Rowena, to help turn his daughters, Princess Genevieve and her eleven sisters, into royal material. But the Duchess strips the sisters of their fun, including their favorite pastime: dancing. When all hope may be lost, the sisters discover a secret passageway to a magical land where they can dance the night away.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2006-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1KzmjDbhHwBARDzzZZKNC3tqqgd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yBB7PwXRFJ29U8m8SnTcWVizFvM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1KzmjDbhHwBARDzzZZKNC3tqqgd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yBB7PwXRFJ29U8m8SnTcWVizFvM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9693,"title":"Children of Men","description":"In 2027, in a chaotic world in which humans can no longer procreate, a former activist agrees to help transport a miraculously pregnant woman to a sanctuary at sea, where her child''s birth may help scientists save the future of humankind.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller","Action"],"release_date":"2006-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.