rds disaster as she divorces her husband and starts a successful restaurant business to support her spoiled daughter.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1945-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iWAijx2874J0QgNVXwqW24IMRai.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3bqF5bJPjeITNeC8ydbUOQZfuqP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iWAijx2874J0QgNVXwqW24IMRai.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3bqF5bJPjeITNeC8ydbUOQZfuqP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":426426,"title":"Roma","description":"In 1970s Mexico City, two domestic workers help a mother of four while her husband is away for an extended period of time.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-11-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zl9uqCl5iUSb50sTk2BPzw6bJnU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dtIIyQyALk57ko5bjac7hi01YQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zl9uqCl5iUSb50sTk2BPzw6bJnU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dtIIyQyALk57ko5bjac7hi01YQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24160,"title":"My Friends Act II","description":"The four old friends meet on the grave of the fifth of them, Perozzi, who died at the end of the first episode. Time has passed but they are still up for adventures and cruel jokes, and while they recall the one they created together with the late friend, new ones are on their way, starting right there at the cemetery.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1982-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AtaH2jdp845H6oK59bkLlf25XXC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fkEx0jDetl0yfU0K9wyaaz0A9w4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AtaH2jdp845H6oK59bkLlf25XXC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fkEx0jDetl0yfU0K9wyaaz0A9w4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26371,"