 that Substitute Soul Reaper Ichigo Kurosaki is the key to their freedom.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2010-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nuQSpGRKJkxnLOMWzZD8UZ6E92B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pd7V5iCB19VBPJkihxFXFwSRW2M.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nuQSpGRKJkxnLOMWzZD8UZ6E92B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pd7V5iCB19VBPJkihxFXFwSRW2M.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9289,"title":"The Longest Day","description":"The retelling of June 6, 1944, from the perspectives of the Germans, US, British, Canadians, and the Free French. Marshall Erwin Rommel, touring the defenses being established as part of the Reich''s Atlantic Wall, notes to his officers that when the Allied invasion comes they must be stopped on the beach. \"For the Allies as well as the Germans, it will be the longest day\"","duration":"2:58:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1962-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yt9FIS2Osm97M7w4dLFkBu7YxW8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5zmvEofdIlgXrQl9A7e5IOzlnFU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yt9FIS2Osm97M7w4dLFkBu7YxW8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5zmvEofdIlgXrQl9A7e5IOzlnFU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25768,"title":"Steamboat Bill, Jr.","description":"The just-out-of-college, effete son of a no-nonsense steamboat captain comes to visit his father whom he''s not seen since he was a child.","duration":"1:10:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1928-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kmZjw9hbo8ErovofQvPB21HRyRf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zygJMsmXxeyDc1N67OCZc8xtq4I.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kmZjw9hbo8ErovofQvPB21HRyRf.jpg","small_post