ing the best fighters from prisons around the globe, enticing them with the promise of freedom for the winner - Boyka must reclaim his dignity and fight for his position in the tournament.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-04-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fTZlSRATSk7QJyUrpbmjScDtY8Z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g8KB77SPA7SyU8eid6TAEpt9skU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fTZlSRATSk7QJyUrpbmjScDtY8Z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g8KB77SPA7SyU8eid6TAEpt9skU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9444,"title":"Anastasia","description":"Ten years after she was separated from her family, an eighteen-year-old orphan with vague memories of the past sets out to Paris in hopes of reuniting with her grandmother. She is accompanied by two con men, who intend to pass her off as the Grand Duchess Anastasia to the Dowager Empress for a reward.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"1997-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h6VshReCGaGQoaGZwT2wqiqrcZW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bppGWGA8zq1sRvTdDJnUzVW9GcH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h6VshReCGaGQoaGZwT2wqiqrcZW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bppGWGA8zq1sRvTdDJnUzVW9GcH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":819,"title":"Sleepers","description":"Two gangsters seek revenge on the state jail worker who during their stay at a youth prison sexually abused them. A sensational court hearing takes place to charge him for the crimes.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1996-10-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sDhABATFQX8nfTHShTfH8HeqKY1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yUpiEk2EojS9ZEXb3nIQonQCYYF.jpg","small_backdro