s for a new classmate.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2020-07-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bXdCpL1A1mW2sEBiTmYYFnb10XN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mb7wQv0adK3kjOUr9n93mANHhPJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bXdCpL1A1mW2sEBiTmYYFnb10XN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mb7wQv0adK3kjOUr9n93mANHhPJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1214931,"title":"Nuremberg","description":"In postwar Germany, an American psychiatrist must determine whether Nazi prisoners are fit to go on trial for war crimes, and finds himself in a complex battle of intellect and ethics with Hermann Göring, Hitler''s right-hand man.","duration":"2:29:00","genre":["History","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-11-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bf5TG9RODkPXmtJSgf8Iymof1wl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xthXNYltOOm80vW5Kxjzxx5gvQ6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bf5TG9RODkPXmtJSgf8Iymof1wl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xthXNYltOOm80vW5Kxjzxx5gvQ6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":614917,"title":"King Richard","description":"The story of how Richard Williams served as a coach to his daughters Venus and Serena, who will soon become two of the most legendary tennis players in history.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2021-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ljCKYCSRMNyZNyke5Lc1I8nW5b2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2dfujXrxePtYJPiPHj1HkAFQvpu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ljCKYCSRMNyZNyke5Lc1I8nW5b2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2dfujXrxePtYJPiPHj1HkAFQvpu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4982,"title":"American Gangster","description":"Loosely based on the criminal career of Frank Lucas, a gangster from La Grange, 