2//kO4KjUkQOfWSBw06Bdl7m6AlEP7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15137,"title":"Evangelion: 1.0 You Are (Not) Alone","description":"After the Second Impact, Tokyo-3 is being attacked by giant monsters called Angels that seek to eradicate humankind. The child Shinji’s objective is to fight the Angels by piloting one of the mysterious Evangelion mecha units. A remake of the first six episodes of GAINAX’s famous 1996 anime series. The film was retitled “Evangelion: 1.01” for its DVD release and “Evangelion: 1.11” for a release with additional scenes.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ktzhr2m6y98PtwOdfOtTA0X232m.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pETU4GurpeEjBOM8oytMH0yNBHx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ktzhr2m6y98PtwOdfOtTA0X232m.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pETU4GurpeEjBOM8oytMH0yNBHx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":841755,"title":"Mortal Kombat Legends: Battle of the Realms","description":"When Shao Kahn''s Outworld barbarians terrorize Earthrealm, Lord Raiden is determined to put an end to the carnage once and for all. This leaves one option: a final Mortal Kombat tournament for the future of Earthrealm – win it or lose everything. Raiden''s elite fighters Liu Kang, Johnny Cage, Sonya Blade, and a few new faces kick the action into overdrive as they go head-to-head with Outworld''s most bloodthirsty warriors. But deep in the Netherrealm, an unspeakable scheme by the malevolent Shinnok unfolds, threatening to obliterate existence.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2021-08-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dssCw0mUmD4EriUmkwB3PnsGu4q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ablrE8IbWcIrAxMmm4gnPn75AMS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dssCw0mUmD4Er