","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Animation","History"],"release_date":"2007-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mfu8cTvpJwrnu3sm2vDqh7o4yXX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lMsUYZq5ITW3rAqF3tB7v74KEnH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mfu8cTvpJwrnu3sm2vDqh7o4yXX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lMsUYZq5ITW3rAqF3tB7v74KEnH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":995,"title":"Stagecoach","description":"A group of people traveling on a stagecoach find their journey complicated by the threat of Geronimo, and learn something about each other in the process.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1939-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7SYNEG50fKODsTP6h9phYM3BueV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zgMnfnwWZ3nkx4t0bUDEKtW24O8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7SYNEG50fKODsTP6h9phYM3BueV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zgMnfnwWZ3nkx4t0bUDEKtW24O8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18,"title":"The Fifth Element","description":"In 2257, a taxi driver is unintentionally given the task of saving a young girl who is part of the key that will ensure the survival of humanity.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"1997-05-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jW21PoKwqs79wk6bfiYezox63mK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fPtlCO1yQtnoLHOwKtWz7db6RGU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jW21PoKwqs79wk6bfiYezox63mK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fPtlCO1yQtnoLHOwKtWz7db6RGU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9343,"title":"Fitzcarraldo","description":"Fitzcarraldo is a dreamer who plans to build an opera house in Iquitos, in the Peruvian Amazon, so, in order to finance his project, he embarks on an epic adventure to collect rubber, a very profitable product, in a remote and unexplored region of the rainforest.","duration":"2:37:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1982-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/46iMqI1qzAtnXJxGRNCFwYNYqOo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oBCnYEKcg1rMhr5JjDnrRpilvDd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//46iMqI1qzAtnXJxGRNCFwYNYqOo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oBCnYEKcg1rMhr5JjDnrRpilvDd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1541,"title":"Thelma & Louise","description":"Taking a break from their dreary lives, close friends Thelma and Louise embark on a short weekend trip that ends in unforeseen incriminating circumstances. As fugitives, both women rediscover the strength of their bond and their newfound resilience.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Adventure"],"release_date":"1991-05-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u49EZzHvGCNrHdQxkc3hhLmQEPP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vbRAGLzbC75QfiKD1lKjmnQGuph.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u49EZzHvGCNrHdQxkc3hhLmQEPP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vbRAGLzbC75QfiKD1lKjmnQGuph.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":820,"title":"JFK","description":"Follows the investigation into the assassination of President John F. Kennedy led by New Orleans district attorney Jim Garrison.","duration":"3:09:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","History"],"release_date":"1991-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/77gjiDyD94aJfqZq6AJAcMLxZhd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r0VWVTYlqdRCK5ZoOdNnHdqM2gt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//77gjiDyD94aJfqZq6AJAcMLxZhd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r0VWVTYlqdRCK5ZoOdNnHdqM2gt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":768744,"title":"My Hero Academia: World Heroes'' Mission","description":"A mysterious group called Humarize strongly believes in the Quirk Singularity Doomsday theory which states that when quirks get mixed further in with future generations, that power will bring forth the end of humanity. In order to save everyone, the Pro-Heroes around the world ask UA Academy heroes-in-training to assist them and form a world-class selected hero team. It’s up to the heroes to save the world and the future of heroes in what is the most dangerous crisis to take place yet in My Hero Academia.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2021-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g3pIN5kRvmtcdtzjsJomZ1sw2QO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jzP5rPwwNqUGERlrUzKKljfyulf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g3pIN5kRvmtcdtzjsJomZ1sw2QO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jzP5rPwwNqUGERlrUzKKljfyulf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":185574,"title":"Louis C.K.: Oh My God","description":"Filmed at the Celebrity Theatre in Phoenix, AZ on February 15th and 16th, 2013, Oh My God is Louis C.K.''s fifth stand-up special, his first for HBO since 2007''s Shameless, and his first since winning a Emmy Award for writing on his acclaimed show on FX, Louie.  Performed in the round in front of a live audience, he discusses such topics as the food chain, animals, divorce, strange anecdotes, broken morality, murder and mortality.","duration":"0:58:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fEMUwqYwHQq5lokxGI1BsSG0LFK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4roFbQgNik1M8oTN7anqihfNF2i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fEMUwqYwHQq5lokxGI1BsSG0LFK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4roFbQgNik1M8oTN7anqihfNF2i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10322,"title":"Being There","description":"A simple-