e":"Dragonkeeper","description":"Set in Han Imperial China, the plot follows the adventures of enslaved girl Ping with ancient dragon Long Danzi. Dragons had been banished from the kingdom. Ping, an orphan, finds one of the last remaining dragon eggs. Palace guards force Ping to run away in order to return the dragon egg to the ocean and save all dragons from extinction. Ping discovers that she is a true Dragonkeeper.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2024-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h9YlRHAZWOWtGonllmj6JJg1FrE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ggZGnJLzO3BTu7ysuuIzou3Oex5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h9YlRHAZWOWtGonllmj6JJg1FrE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ggZGnJLzO3BTu7ysuuIzou3Oex5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":502356,"title":"The Super Mario Bros. Movie","description":"While working underground to fix a water main, Brooklyn plumbers—and brothers—Mario and Luigi are transported down a mysterious pipe and wander into a magical new world. But when the brothers are separated, Mario embarks on an epic quest to find Luigi.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy","Animation"],"release_date":"2023-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9n2tJBplPbgR2ca05hS5CKXwP2c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qNBAXBIQlnOThrVvA6mA2B5ggV6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9n2tJBplPbgR2ca05hS5CKXwP2c.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qNBAXBIQlnOThrVvA6mA2B5ggV6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":364111,"title":"The Anthem of the Heart","description":"A young girl had her voice magically taken away so that she would never hurt people with it, but her outlook changes when she encounters music and friendship. Will Naruse be able to convey the anthem of her heart?","duration":"1: