ace/4FnbeuCnsN3MT6omPrivl2ttJ8o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7tvAnzZj9e9AjdoHaN9jshm2Cjw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4FnbeuCnsN3MT6omPrivl2ttJ8o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7tvAnzZj9e9AjdoHaN9jshm2Cjw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":283587,"title":"Beasts of No Nation","description":"Based on the experiences of Agu, a child fighting in the civil war of a West African country. Follows Agu''s journey as he''s forced to join a group of soldiers. While he fears his commander and many of the men around him, his fledgling childhood has been brutally shattered by the war raging through his country, and he is at first torn between conflicting revulsion and fascination.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"2015-09-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vDfbeUK3OhoeyQRlUODwfSy6tyE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1D4vcJmJc58WXarpRtwgd2do9Rg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vDfbeUK3OhoeyQRlUODwfSy6tyE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1D4vcJmJc58WXarpRtwgd2do9Rg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":54186,"title":"Confessions","description":"Devastated at the death of her four-year-old daughter, a grieving middle school teacher is horrified to discover that her students aren''t as innocent as she thinks.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"2010-06-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sT7f721Zvb9Feo11sbhvkk2JLHi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xn98VCLMcF6TulxsKJq2EQ8WYL2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sT7f721Zvb9Feo11sbhvkk2JLHi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xn98VCLMcF6TulxsKJq2EQ8WYL2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":33665,"title":"Opening Night","description":"Actress Myrtle Gordon is a functioning alcoholic who is a few days from the opening night of her latest play, concerning a woman distraught about aging. One night a car kills one of Myrtle''s fans who is chasing her limousine in an attempt to get the star''s attention. Myrtle internalizes the accident and goes on a spiritual quest, but fails to finds the answers she is after. As opening night inches closer and closer, fragile Myrtle must find a way to make the show go on.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1977-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gp7rYRo09ir7NEnrQURymsD95RG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5i1331f4Q2sNHUp9X3BOwWPS2Gg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gp7rYRo09ir7NEnrQURymsD95RG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5i1331f4Q2sNHUp9X3BOwWPS2Gg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13562,"title":"My Man Godfrey","description":"Fifth Avenue socialite Irene Bullock needs a \"forgotten man\" to win a scavenger hunt, and no one is more forgotten than Godfrey Park, who resides in a dump by the East River. Irene hires Godfrey as a servant for her riotously unhinged family, to the chagrin of her spoiled sister, Cornelia, who tries her best to get Godfrey fired. As Irene falls for her new butler, Godfrey turns the tables and teaches the frivolous Bullocks a lesson or two.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1936-09-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/96cNUk1Uj8fQcmbOTnpBauUdqzC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wtfOW7fIxBZWY78rvUoPpWhMSiR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//96cNUk1Uj8fQcmbOTnpBauUdqzC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wtfOW7fIxBZWY78rvUoPpWhMSiR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12206,"title":"The Testament of Dr. Mabuse","description":"After a detective is assaulted by thugs and placed in an asylum run by Professor Baum, he observes the professor''s preoccupation with another patient, the criminal genius Dr. Mabuse the hypnotist. When Mabuse''s notes are found to be connected with a rash of recent crimes, Commissioner Lohmann must determine how Mabuse is communicating with the criminals, despite conflicting reports on the doctor''s whereabouts, and capture him for good.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1933-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1cqCq9KJUeeygcUpip4qfokmQG2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tc2ET7j6X066VCjdHblSwLr8sEz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1cqCq9KJUeeygcUpip4qfokmQG2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tc2ET7j6X066VCjdHblSwLr8sEz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":244,"title":"King Kong","description":"Adventurous filmmaker Carl Denham sets out to produce a motion picture unlike anything the world has seen before. Alongside his leading lady Ann Darrow and his first mate Jack Driscoll, they arrive on an island and discover a legendary creature said to be neither beast nor man. Denham captures the monster to be displayed on Broadway as King Kong, the eighth wonder of the world.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"1933-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lYfHa1AtkUMtplrKx7SRLHpwonW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lHlnxKL5GbgRibyRFI7n1Ey850i.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lYfHa1AtkUMtplrKx7SRLHpwonW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lHlnxKL5GbgRibyRFI7n1Ey850i.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":533535,"title":"Deadpool & Wolverine","description":"A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Action","Comedy",