hion bible Elle magazine, has a devastating stroke at age 43. The damage to his brain stem results in locked-in syndrome, with which he is almost completely paralyzed and only able to communicate by blinking an eye. Bauby painstakingly dictates his memoir via the only means of expression left to him.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2007-05-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8v9UL4hL4WDC58IrKb9bkBz0kIQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6NkJ4gnLrvLj0PZDW6sNM85JMbj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8v9UL4hL4WDC58IrKb9bkBz0kIQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6NkJ4gnLrvLj0PZDW6sNM85JMbj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":56784,"title":"Sorry for the Delay","description":"Vincenzo, a 30 years old apathetic and lazy man who still lives with his mother, has no job and no desire to improve. He meets Anna and fell in love with her but to keep the relationship alive he has to learn to accept more responsibility.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1983-03-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rVARQIfs2gOsAqQYsnmw4xueDSe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zfjaHGdhXEauoz8JFSZjN0li0I7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rVARQIfs2gOsAqQYsnmw4xueDSe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zfjaHGdhXEauoz8JFSZjN0li0I7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":770254,"title":"Back to the Outback","description":"Tired of being locked in a reptile house where humans gawk at them like they are monsters, a ragtag group of Australia’s deadliest creatures plot an escape from their zoo to the Outback, a place where they’ll fit in without being judged.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Adventure","Comedy"],"release_date":"2021-12-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5B22eed7ErxFiYAG4Ksb4eLwKNF.jpg","poster_path":"h