, although married to another, falls in love with a political activist''s wife and experiences hardship during World War I and then the October Revolution.","duration":"3:20:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","War"],"release_date":"1965-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wUaDgHfW7fViru7IubWa6Nronq9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r0Iv2BiCFYDnzc6uU1q3AJ56igT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wUaDgHfW7fViru7IubWa6Nronq9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r0Iv2BiCFYDnzc6uU1q3AJ56igT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":433,"title":"Mary Poppins","description":"In turn of the century London, a magical nanny employs music and adventure to help two neglected children become closer to their father.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1964-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nMXLizoHhVTeh3GjFyUOfNx3b7i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o4Wsby4ydIXhWmtmfvb451D5Np1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nMXLizoHhVTeh3GjFyUOfNx3b7i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o4Wsby4ydIXhWmtmfvb451D5Np1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":707886,"title":"Feel the Beat","description":"After failing to make it on Broadway, April returns to her hometown and reluctantly begins training a misfit group of young dancers for a competition.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Comedy","Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-06-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fZBQOScjDT8TAipEyCkLVeDTu5c.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Af2jt7m9GLFpR4V11xOsFmT8OKD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fZBQOScjDT8TAipEyCkLVeDTu5c.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Af2jt7m9GLFpR4V11xOsFmT8OKD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":73456,"title":"Barbie: Princess Charm School","description":"Barbie stars as 