w342//gl8TvgVL6B2PR71cnrG7PbAUPls.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13345,"title":"A Chinese Odyssey Part One: Pandora''s Box","description":"When the Goddess of Happiness tosses the Longevity Monk and his disciples out of heaven (because the Monkey King tried to attain immortality), the Monkey King is reincarnated as the Joker. He now spends his time chasing two jealous women. When one of them is dying, the Joker goes back in time in an attempt to save her.","duration":"1:28:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1995-01-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cvpq5L0LSrTvLBokQ0tsFdEysJ6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wIDDJ3FXPmVnNpxVoZOvjjcKVqj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cvpq5L0LSrTvLBokQ0tsFdEysJ6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wIDDJ3FXPmVnNpxVoZOvjjcKVqj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11178,"title":"My Sassy Girl","description":"A young man’s world is turned upside down when a female force of nature takes his life by storm in this outrageous and uplifting ode to true love.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2001-07-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/13uKAt4M87HQi1lMZAwBmsNZRGg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i964xFDEMwZ5uaweParv8ItBfbJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//13uKAt4M87HQi1lMZAwBmsNZRGg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i964xFDEMwZ5uaweParv8ItBfbJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":228150,"title":"Fury","description":"April, 1945. As the Allies make their final push in the European Theater, a battle-hardened army sergeant commands a Sherman tank with a five-man crew on a deadly mission behind enemy lines.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["War","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2014-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/95ckrV6wQgbffurAVmETQ5YKASL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pfte7wdMobMF4CVHuOxyu6oqeeA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//95ckrV6wQgbffurAVmETQ5YKASL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pfte7wdMobMF4CVHuOxyu6oqeeA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29084,"title":"Le Corbeau","description":"Remy Germain is a doctor in a French town who becomes the focus of a vicious smear campaign, as letters accusing him of having an affair and performing unlawful abortions are mailed to village leaders. The mysterious writer, who signs each letter as \"Le Corbeau\" (The Raven) soon targets the whole town, exposing everyone''s dark secrets.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Mystery","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1943-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sUvL8Qhl349pRBr4WESwN9LkAYw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Oh4hCD2nni5JJpGGIhD3CutfNI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sUvL8Qhl349pRBr4WESwN9LkAYw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Oh4hCD2nni5JJpGGIhD3CutfNI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20108,"title":"Au Hasard Balthazar","description":"The story of a donkey Balthazar as he is passed from owner to owner, some kind and some cruel but all with motivations beyond his understanding. Balthazar, whose life parallels that of his first keeper, Marie, is truly a beast of burden, suffering the sins of humankind. But despite his powerlessness, he accepts his fate nobly.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1966-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7LPz7NEYtLXcV44j0kRLLkZ54yH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lkLO1HDzzaXpTXtAgnGpVqIQkvF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7LPz7NEYtLXcV44j0kRLLkZ54yH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lkLO1HDzzaXpTXtAgnGpVqIQkvF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1556,"title":"Funeral Parade of Roses","description":"In 1960s Tokyo, Gonda owns a bar in which the gay, cross-dresser, and trans scenes meet. Gonda is in a relationship with the madam of the bar, Leda. As the younger Eddie starts a passionate affair with Gonda, she ignites the jealousy of Leda, unaware of another kind of history between them.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1969-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wRBjG7wFxb4ewOWKWAarfbKARtK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7cRQ6rSGajW2soWDr3voEN2rgYO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wRBjG7wFxb4ewOWKWAarfbKARtK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7cRQ6rSGajW2soWDr3voEN2rgYO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":747,"title":"Shaun of the Dead","description":"Shaun lives a supremely uneventful life, which revolves around his girlfriend, his mother, and, above all, his local pub. This gentle routine is threatened when the dead return to life and make strenuous attempts to snack on ordinary Londoners.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Horror","Comedy"],"release_date":"2004-04-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wb34q3VgzHgL8frVMywrN3wXmqx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dgXPhzNJH8HFTBjXPB177yNx6RI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wb34q3VgzHgL8frVMywrN3wXmqx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dgXPhzNJH8HFTBjXPB177yNx6RI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1288445,"title":"Mutiny","description":"After witnessing his billionaire boss'' murder and being framed for the crime, Cole Reed boards a cargo ship on a one-man crusade to avenge his boss'' death only to discover an international conspiracy.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-08-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e2QAGrEmbpmZpMymDRkDisJkvg9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pu2VxGlpGwffOx29