e arrangements for a black market abortion.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/phYwx0HKSdcQyOuK5bMMO8woETT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/acEtvzFPeOQwbzRWncjRLenhnKV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//phYwx0HKSdcQyOuK5bMMO8woETT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//acEtvzFPeOQwbzRWncjRLenhnKV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":615,"title":"The Passion of the Christ","description":"A graphic portrayal of the last twelve hours of Jesus of Nazareth''s life.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2004-02-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4840rkbpsiuow5ew155oVKcqJwj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rBM5o2HpmCfDejuIPybI09tkY3V.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4840rkbpsiuow5ew155oVKcqJwj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rBM5o2HpmCfDejuIPybI09tkY3V.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":127585,"title":"X-Men: Days of Future Past","description":"The ultimate X-Men ensemble fights a war for the survival of the species across two time periods as they join forces with their younger selves in an epic battle that must change the past – to save our future.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2014-05-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3czpqXzFy5UcNuD1AubecRLWkwD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tYfijzolzgoMOtegh1Y7j2Enorg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3czpqXzFy5UcNuD1AubecRLWkwD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tYfijzolzgoMOtegh1Y7j2Enorg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22292,"title":"The Ghost and Mrs. Muir","description":"In 1900, young widow Lucy Muir learns that her seaside cottage is haunted and forms a unique relationship with the ghost.","duration":