 kind of life. When a relative dies and leaves Deeds a fortune, Longfellow moves to the big city where he becomes an instant target for everyone. Deeds outwits them all until Babe Bennett comes along. When small-town boy meets big-city girl anything can, and does, happen.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1936-04-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4HndddVOLbvifowXjNpdkkF8Q71.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/20p5Cxib8wX0AyGl5i1uwPm6UwC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4HndddVOLbvifowXjNpdkkF8Q71.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//20p5Cxib8wX0AyGl5i1uwPm6UwC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":429450,"title":"Pandora","description":"When an earthquake hits a Korean village housing a run-down nuclear power plant, a man risks his life to save the country from imminent disaster.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2016-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yc8Fl1P5aQwBHEAtB49MO9fpjmw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/elTrkTm5GjynK3H26cpOZsWDYjy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yc8Fl1P5aQwBHEAtB49MO9fpjmw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//elTrkTm5GjynK3H26cpOZsWDYjy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15472,"title":"The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo","description":"Swedish thriller based on Stieg Larsson''s novel about a male journalist and a young female hacker. In the opening of the movie, Mikael Blomkvist, a middle-aged publisher for the magazine Millennium, loses a libel case brought by corrupt Swedish industrialist Hans-Erik Wennerström. Nevertheless, he is hired by Henrik Vanger in order to solve a cold case, the disappearance of Vanger''s niece","duration":"2:32:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"2009-02-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dPE25PbaeE6fCR2SQb4H4MeBmml.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r2pFUXKK20KD9RE3yybpQsNynRE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dPE25PbaeE6fCR2SQb4H4MeBmml.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r2pFUXKK20KD9RE3yybpQsNynRE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":319,"title":"True Romance","description":"Clarence marries hooker Alabama, steals cocaine from her pimp, and tries to sell it in Hollywood, while the owners of the coke try to reclaim it.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Romance"],"release_date":"1993-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1Uh8yuXlFcMDpVHWZJidjanT06e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/39lXk6ud6KiJgGbbWI2PUKS7y2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1Uh8yuXlFcMDpVHWZJidjanT06e.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//39lXk6ud6KiJgGbbWI2PUKS7y2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":870360,"title":"The Day the Earth Blew Up: A Looney Tunes Movie","description":"Porky and Daffy, the classic animated odd couple, turn into unlikely heroes when their antics at the local bubble gum factory uncover a secret alien mind control plot. Against all odds, the two are determined to save their town (and the world!)...that is if they don''t drive each other crazy in the process.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Animation","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2024-08-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5U3VLeWr2H4Nd3G7IkHItFimsIz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s2lB1kaYCdGSnZX5meQCiOR6HfX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5U3VLeWr2H4Nd3G7IkHItFimsIz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s2lB1kaYCdGSnZX5meQCiOR6HfX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":507569,"title":"The Seven Deadly Sins: Prisoners of the Sky","description":"Traveling in search of the rare ingredient, “sky fish”  Meliodas and Hawk arrive at a palace that floats above the clouds. The people there are busy preparing a ceremony, meant to protect their home from a ferocious beast that awakens once every 3,000 years. But before the ritual is complete, the Six Knights of Black—a Demon Clan army—removes the seal on the beast, threatening the lives of everyone in the Sky Palace.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Animation"],"release_date":"2018-08-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e6CnfsN7wnhZEMqh5EnCfTDXQ7g.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/63NOOAkaZAK8h93Sg7Ucq6XLJGP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e6CnfsN7wnhZEMqh5EnCfTDXQ7g.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//63NOOAkaZAK8h93Sg7Ucq6XLJGP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":433471,"title":"Lou","description":"A lost-and-found box holds a mysterious and unseen monster within.","duration":"0:06:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Animation","Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f13RF99zjorGVJnSSsOqyj5dzYh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4l9wSwvabTefMJ3TkXnh9evzmVV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f13RF99zjorGVJnSSsOqyj5dzYh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4l9wSwvabTefMJ3TkXnh9evzmVV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":306819,"title":"The Danish Girl","description":"When Gerda Wegener asks her husband Einar to fill in as a portrait model, Einar discovers the person she''s meant to be and begins living her life as Lili Elbe. Having realized her true self and with Gerda''s love and support, Lili embarks on a groundbreaking journey as a transgender pioneer.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-11-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d0tzLbn62WANaq5mnyLpCJsJq1B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kiJTZ5oFRO961w