 and out-of-work Eddie Bartlett becomes a cab driver. Eddie builds a fleet of cabs through delivery of bootleg liquor and hires Lloyd as his lawyer. George becomes Eddie''s partner and the rackets flourish until love and rivalry interfere.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1939-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ujZtDH8CSiVETuK9ancFTPAmZr6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nkymdElqwJBm2bl3F6hJp4xJggD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ujZtDH8CSiVETuK9ancFTPAmZr6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nkymdElqwJBm2bl3F6hJp4xJggD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":967,"title":"Spartacus","description":"The rebellious Thracian Spartacus, born and raised a slave, is sold to Gladiator trainer Batiatus. After weeks of being trained to kill for the arena, Spartacus turns on his owners and leads the other slaves in rebellion. As the rebels move from town to town, their numbers swell as escaped slaves join their ranks. Under the leadership of Spartacus, they make their way to southern Italy, where they will cross the sea and return to their homes.","duration":"3:17:00","genre":["History","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1960-10-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9caD0fGCrp96JTFFeGyI0CGNj7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nqU4xAn3ygWA4fvXSBufRwdGhpr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9caD0fGCrp96JTFFeGyI0CGNj7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nqU4xAn3ygWA4fvXSBufRwdGhpr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9366,"title":"Donnie Brasco","description":"An FBI undercover agent infiltrates the mob and identifies more with the mafia life at the expense of his regular one.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1997-02-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gXWzBnxUfLCT0w0WzAmJ5wF37hC.jp