s lover, Sandro, on a boat trip to a remote volcanic island. When Anna goes missing, a search is launched. In the meantime, Sandro and Claudia become involved in a romance despite Anna''s disappearance, though the relationship suffers from guilt and tension.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Romance"],"release_date":"1960-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kF5AeKG5XIZkAXY0kRgm57qEbJI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7kUXAS8K7Ihw1T1mhARjnLuMVk3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kF5AeKG5XIZkAXY0kRgm57qEbJI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7kUXAS8K7Ihw1T1mhARjnLuMVk3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1949,"title":"Zodiac","description":"Police conduct a manhunt for the Zodiac Killer, a serial killer who terrorized the San Francisco Bay Area during the late 1960s and early 1970s, taunting police with letters, bloodstained clothing, and ciphers mailed to newspapers.","duration":"2:37:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-03-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3zCPI4JFc54xvLaJ71oI2KoP3az.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6YmeO4pB7XTh8P8F960O1uA14JO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3zCPI4JFc54xvLaJ71oI2KoP3az.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6YmeO4pB7XTh8P8F960O1uA14JO.jpg"}]'::jsonb
