XqXr06r.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":220,"title":"East of Eden","description":"In the Salinas Valley in and around World War I, Cal Trask feels he must compete against overwhelming odds with his brother for the love of their father. Cal is frustrated at every turn, from his reaction to the war, how to get ahead in business and in life, and how to relate to his estranged mother.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1955-04-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u7i1XtbOubq0xwRy2Zbgmox6g9W.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xv1MZVIop0SQqwLUymgE5eb2LFl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u7i1XtbOubq0xwRy2Zbgmox6g9W.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xv1MZVIop0SQqwLUymgE5eb2LFl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":308369,"title":"Me and Earl and the Dying Girl","description":"Greg is coasting through senior year of high school as anonymously as possible, avoiding social interactions like the plague while secretly making spirited, bizarre films with Earl, his only friend. But both his anonymity and friendship threaten to unravel when his mother forces him to befriend a classmate with leukemia.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2015-06-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4sOeeDX9uBteu81ty2bcdbzU933.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eLjS2bLMjln2n2I73Xu6TaANPDZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4sOeeDX9uBteu81ty2bcdbzU933.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eLjS2bLMjln2n2I73Xu6TaANPDZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2487,"title":"Lady Snowblood","description":"A strikingly beautiful young woman is trained from birth to be a deadly instrument of revenge against the swindlers who destroyed her family.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1973-12-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sNEO4KDId