ively. What secrets does this enigmatic man hide?","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6SRoBPlzXUasFegwnY0s4hbpqJz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2ubdrvMHcRTFzkUdmSIuvupLqRS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6SRoBPlzXUasFegwnY0s4hbpqJz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2ubdrvMHcRTFzkUdmSIuvupLqRS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19413,"title":"Ugly, Dirty and Bad","description":"Giacinto lives with his wife, their ten children and various other family members in a shack on the hills of Rome. Some time ago he has lost his left eye while at work, and got a consistent sum of money from the insurance company, which he keeps hidden from the rest of the family. His whole life is now based on defending the money he sees as his own, while the rest of the family tries to kill him.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1976-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lZzW1Y6sDGhbnOh8NuMwUlOVVVe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rl2wUqZAZSEXymyvH3U7onEQfMN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lZzW1Y6sDGhbnOh8NuMwUlOVVVe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rl2wUqZAZSEXymyvH3U7onEQfMN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13353,"title":"It''s the Great Pumpkin, Charlie Brown","description":"Join the Peanuts gang for a timeless adventure as Charlie Brown preps for a party, Snoopy sets his sights on the Red Baron, and Linus patiently awaits a pumpkin patch miracle.","duration":"0:25:00","genre":["Family","Animation","TV Movie","Comedy"],"release_date":"1966-10-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k7F9aj6Vmz8rJ9lcm2mIgUiWDWV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/59wp9OWexYsxlSPHYmVLsl5xlFt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k7F9aj6Vmz8rJ9lcm2mIgUiWDWV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//59wp9OWexYsxlSPHYmVLsl5xlFt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9040,"title":"Serpico","description":"New York cop Frank Serpico blows the whistle on the rampant corruption in the force only to have his comrades turn against him.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1973-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dXlO2Ri2RvVYWRtBsr6GsIVkleX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pRagfd10PPWryFRSzLPIivfAXHJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dXlO2Ri2RvVYWRtBsr6GsIVkleX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pRagfd10PPWryFRSzLPIivfAXHJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":7549,"title":"Fearless","description":"After going through a series of tragic events in his life, martial arts master Huo Yuanjia returns to Tianjin and must fight four international soldiers, in order to safeguard his nation''s pride.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Action"],"release_date":"2006-01-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sumVr8uduhPwx4H3cWjrP76i3AB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t2YyrNs25lic2ql8T9nPFZmqni2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sumVr8uduhPwx4H3cWjrP76i3AB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t2YyrNs25lic2ql8T9nPFZmqni2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":58451,"title":"The Adventures of Pinocchio","description":"Mastro Geppetto is a poor carpenter with no wife and no children. The man is very lonely, and after trading a piece of wood with his colleague Mastro Ciliegia, decides to build himself a puppet to keep him company.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"1972-12-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1gAIPtpuHSYWJ6PjF8r9jOJdSmG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xjoYc9umKoZHTVr2B0uBbn3bCXj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1gAIPtpuHSYWJ6PjF8r9jOJdSmG.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xjoYc9umKoZHTVr2B0uBbn3bCXj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21028,"title":"Moscow Does Not Believe in Tears","description":"Living together in a workers'' dorm, Katerina and her friends are determined to make it in Moscow. But when a boorish cameraman forces himself on her, Katerina finds herself pregnant and alone as her friends move on. Twenty years later, Katerina is a factory director, outpacing her old roommates career-wise, yet still alone but for her daughter. Love seems possible again when she meets a genial mechanic.","duration":"2:22:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1980-02-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eVbDEVjNIj2fRBiWObMTcuI5bI3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r0VULHcfJ2njqOI0GuQHe4TNF5e.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eVbDEVjNIj2fRBiWObMTcuI5bI3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r0VULHcfJ2njqOI0GuQHe4TNF5e.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9470,"title":"Kung Fu Hustle","description":"It''s the 1940s, and the notorious Axe Gang terrorizes Shanghai. Small-time criminals Sing and Bone hope to join, but they only manage to make lots of very dangerous enemies. Fortunately for them, kung fu masters and hidden strength can be found in unlikely places. Now they just have to take on the entire Axe Gang.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Crime","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2004-02-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9XhZhoSnFJ3AjpfzdIiZVHLQIS4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/exbyTbrvRUDKN2mcNEuVor4VFQW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9XhZhoSnFJ3AjpfzdIiZVHLQIS4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//exbyTbrvRUDKN2mcNEuVor4VFQW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1613798,"title":"Vengeance","description":"The brutal murder of the wife of “Toro,” a military hero in the special forces, turns him into a man with a single purpose: revenge. After a stroke of fate makes him a millionaire, Carlos transforms his fortune into an arsenal and, together with his closest soldiers, sets out to hunt down those responsible.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-02-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xyW8rJO3rwG2EGcTO6eaUEa8b9d.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ygWXPL0RS91JyJPNOfK34eV3bRE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xyW8rJO3rwG2EGcTO6eaUEa8b9d.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ygWXPL0RS91JyJPNOfK34eV3bRE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36210,"title":"Not One Less","description":"Set in the People''s Republic of China during the 1990s, the film centers on a 13-year-old substitute teacher, Wei Minzhi, in the Chinese countryside. Called in to substitute for a village teacher for one month, Wei is told not to lose any students.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1999-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3YtzK8eWLjJ23xxXqkqxtaSnKYE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eERKaWCIRh3a8rPjUu1z34OYZD8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3YtzK8eWLjJ23xxXqkqxtaSnKYE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eERKaWCIRh3a8rPjUu1z34OYZD8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5062,"title":"The Inquisitor","description":"Martinaud, an illustrious notary suspected of being the perpetrator of two horrendous crimes, voluntarily agrees to be questioned by Inspector Gallien on New Year''s Eve. What initially is a routine procedure, soon becomes a harsh interrogation that seems to confirm the initial suspicions.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1981-09-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w6