od","description":"In 1980s Naples, an awkward teen struggling to find his place experiences heartbreak and liberation after he''s inadvertently saved from a freak accident by football legend Diego Maradona.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2021-11-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dTvGUMFc5WCziTzXZKZ2EfW2bEM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kreVxr5moB7K52IGGV1BGAn6nq1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dTvGUMFc5WCziTzXZKZ2EfW2bEM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kreVxr5moB7K52IGGV1BGAn6nq1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":379779,"title":"The Present","description":"The short tells the story of a boy who rather spends his time indoors playing videogames instead of discovering whats waiting in front of the door. One day his Mum decides to get a little surprise for her son, which makes it hard for him to concentrate on his video game.","duration":"0:04:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-04-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gq00KEVXn58m7vNAZaZxVCL3unc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3CdUyjIhcW3dMYCzxBzlehfgWu8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gq00KEVXn58m7vNAZaZxVCL3unc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3CdUyjIhcW3dMYCzxBzlehfgWu8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16858,"title":"All That Jazz","description":"Joe Gideon is at the top of the heap, one of the most successful directors and choreographers in musical theater. But he can feel his world slowly collapsing around him - his obsession with work has almost destroyed his personal life, and only his bottles of pills keep him going.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1979-12-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u218sykbUQIh6EWtTdJzguU5LcG.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/culCEdj4srLljefgn4XK