.org/t/p/w342//mX9E4fEuG17L2e7bZmhBc0XdRbw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4960,"title":"Synecdoche, New York","description":"A theater director struggles with his work, and the women in his life, as he attempts to create a life-size replica of New York inside a warehouse as part of his new play.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2008-10-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/insPcjOIWFf6Uc9DR0ORgXATqSM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5UwdhrjXhUgsiDhe1dpS9z4yj7q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//insPcjOIWFf6Uc9DR0ORgXATqSM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5UwdhrjXhUgsiDhe1dpS9z4yj7q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4553,"title":"The Machinist","description":"Trevor, an insomniac lathe operator, experiences unusual occurrences at work and home. A strange man follows him everywhere, but no one else seems to notice him.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2004-09-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hi3lxLd93iKwCmVAfhMV9m1k2jr.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/diAYqR4xdF9Hnj7qun6DEQhRrT2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hi3lxLd93iKwCmVAfhMV9m1k2jr.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//diAYqR4xdF9Hnj7qun6DEQhRrT2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":824,"title":"Moulin Rouge!","description":"A celebration of love and creative inspiration takes place in the infamous, gaudy and glamorous Parisian nightclub, at the cusp of the 20th century. A young poet, who is plunged into the heady world of Moulin Rouge, begins a passionate affair with the club''s most notorious and beautiful star.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Music"],"release_date":"2001-05-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vvcLSgiviCIU0J0UcwLqWdU8Iup.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2kjM5CUZRIU5yOANUowrbJcRL9L