are people from different worlds: Matvey, the son of a lamplighter, whose only treasure is his silver-plated skates; Alice is the daughter of a high-ranking official dreaming of science. Each of them has his own difficult life-story, but having accidentally met they rush forward together in pursuit of their dreams.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Romance","History","Crime","Family"],"release_date":"2020-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n96Mu6w9yGO3MM9yuBrYlVvc6gb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gZSlt41YjSTQE7ah03usHsvmWFs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n96Mu6w9yGO3MM9yuBrYlVvc6gb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gZSlt41YjSTQE7ah03usHsvmWFs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":500664,"title":"Upgrade","description":"A brutal mugging leaves Grey Trace paralyzed in the hospital and his beloved wife dead. A billionaire inventor soon offers Trace a cure — an artificial intelligence implant called STEM that will enhance his body. Now able to walk, Grey finds that he also has superhuman strength and agility — skills he uses to seek revenge against the thugs who destroyed his life.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2018-05-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oiPUcD1IIZrYGTSIpvTmd3dRmPo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/woLGROUdPWdBnLVFKYdGD3kFkPY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oiPUcD1IIZrYGTSIpvTmd3dRmPo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//woLGROUdPWdBnLVFKYdGD3kFkPY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37769,"title":"The Second Tragic Fantozzi","description":"The frustrating adventures of a humble employee who all the time has to fullfill the wishes and desires of his bosses.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1976-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_fa