","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1986-08-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jfDTQuovn57QIBvoGDom6FNQrkl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1E3pliSC7lXWw6zJhMvG6ba0UNX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jfDTQuovn57QIBvoGDom6FNQrkl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1E3pliSC7lXWw6zJhMvG6ba0UNX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9516,"title":"Menace II Society","description":"A young street hustler attempts to escape the rigors and temptations of the ghetto in a quest for a better life.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1993-05-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s5PP0ryxAo12jzvPntSEybahpCw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/guvPiEOeXwROpfCb2LkHkVEvOck.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s5PP0ryxAo12jzvPntSEybahpCw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//guvPiEOeXwROpfCb2LkHkVEvOck.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":556901,"title":"Teen Titans Go! vs. Teen Titans","description":"The comedic modern-day quintet takes on their 2003 counterparts when villains from each of their worlds join forces to pit the two Titan teams against each other. They''ll need to set aside their differences and work together to combat Trigon, Hexagon, Santa Claus (that''s right, Santa!) and time itself in order to save the multiverse.","duration":"1:17:00","genre":["Action","Animation","Comedy","Family","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2019-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iHGukqqDLWSPE6HeJF4fob6r1D7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/GWJEdzVC9aOBSOMF9NHodYxSsE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iHGukqqDLWSPE6HeJF4fob6r1D7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//GWJEdzVC9aOBSOMF9NHodYxSsE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":200481,"title":"The Blue Umbrella","description":"It is just another evening commute until the rain starts to fall, and the city comes alive to the sound of dripping rain pipes, whistling awnings and gurgling gutters.","duration":"0:07:00","genre":["Animation","Romance"],"release_date":"2013-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4nQMxOfOYP4cYI69XRt9Gm1jA2E.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iSWV7ra8HJ3gYnZFMMrPe8CBbrv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4nQMxOfOYP4cYI69XRt9Gm1jA2E.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iSWV7ra8HJ3gYnZFMMrPe8CBbrv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":200085,"title":"The Flu","description":"A case of the flu quickly morphs into a pandemic. As the death toll mounts and the living panic, the government plans extreme measures to contain it.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2013-08-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tLxj077KKhBMjnwJkW322VAIbbk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mvTXhTddHIZbOU9pmrcPODI1kRx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tLxj077KKhBMjnwJkW322VAIbbk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mvTXhTddHIZbOU9pmrcPODI1kRx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":484468,"title":"The Wolf''s Call","description":"Shown from the perspective of a young submariner with unusually sensitive hearing and uncannily precise sound recognition. The fate of many often depends on his ability, and one time, whilst highly stressed, he makes a incorrect call which put his entire crew in mortal danger.  Trying to regain the confidence of his comrades, he conducts an unauthorised investigation of an apparent plot which, it turns out, risks escalating into a nuclear apocalypse. Suddenly working under pressure with the fleet admiral, they must do whatever is necessary, even the unthinkable, to prevent a nuclear war, since a confirmed nuclear strike order cannot be countermanded.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Thriller","Action","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-02-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ujd2rMIVb0Z8orWrEbMWdJsBRYd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8bxIzp9w9l9ZzGVwNaIKOaem05A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ujd2rMIVb0Z8orWrEbMWdJsBRYd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8bxIzp9w9l9ZzGVwNaIKOaem05A.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":44892,"title":"The Music Box","description":"The Laurel & Hardy Moving Co. have a challenging job on their hands (and backs): hauling a player piano up a monumental flight of stairs to Prof. von Schwarzenhoffen''s house. Their task is complicated by a sassy nursemaid and, unbeknownst to them, the impatient Prof. von Schwarzenhoffen himself. But the biggest problem is the force of gravity, which repeatedly pulls the piano back down to the bottom of the stairs.","duration":"0:29:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1932-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d59HQSKIle5PzIdAiHFY6m3yIk1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zwU0Y7VS3d326v1pYY7kif1y7xQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d59HQSKIle5PzIdAiHFY6m3yIk1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zwU0Y7VS3d326v1pYY7kif1y7xQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41245,"title":"Peppermint Candy","description":"In the spring of 1999, a group of old friends gather to celebrate their 20 year reunion. Among the group is Yeong-ho, a cold, unhappy man, whose demeanor puts a damper on the festivities. The seriousness of Yeong-ho''s depression becomes apparent when he climbs a railroad bridge and looks like he might jump. At this crucial moment, memories of seven crucial episodes from Yeong-ho''s past flood his mind.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2000-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d9LNlmhjihHAAP1vKCQJo57JQFX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jPP0gFDgdXRa1YgP8Cn8arzOHI3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d9LNlmhjihHAAP1vKCQJo57JQFX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jPP0gFDgdXRa1YgP8Cn8arzOHI3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":21712,"title":"Mind Game","description":"Nishi is a loser who has a crush on his childhood girlfriend. After an encounter with the Japanese mafia, he journeys to heaven and back, and ends up trapped in an even more unlikely place.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Animation","Romance","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2004-08-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/19SRSM2ybfVpCBxBFLXwyD18WkM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e5mV1iVcjg7nkpJrskQOnFCR4H9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//19SRSM2ybfVpCBxBFLXwyD18WkM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e5mV1iVcjg7nkpJrskQOnFCR4H9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":483983,"title":"Balloon","description":"Two families attempt a daredevil plan to escape the GDR with a homemade hot air balloon, but it crashes just before the border. The Stasi finds traces of this attempt to escape and immediately starts investigations, while the two families are forced to build a new escape balloon. With each passing day the Stasi is closer on their heels – a nerve-wracking race against time begins.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2018-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sKK1fb08uCcTc0w6PlVsx3BXJdg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nRs8A0zp0jU211j8Zay3ApIzlpx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sKK1fb08uCcTc0w6PlVsx3BXJdg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nRs8A0zp0jU211j8Zay3ApIzlpx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":206324,"title":"Bhaag Milkha Bhaag","description":"The true story of the \"Flying Sikh\" world champion runner and Olympian Milkha Singh who overcame the massacre of his family, civil war during the India-Pakistan partition, and homelessness to become one of India''s most iconic athletes.","duration":"3:06:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2013-07-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eryhpwnyvEWnsDapQ9jwbam8itA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bXywc0CEzS1fIshPWWi4V8A58U3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eryhpwnyvEWnsDapQ9jwbam8itA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bXywc0CEzS1fIshPWWi4V8A58U3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":83389,"title":"From Up on Poppy Hill","description":"Yokohama, 1963. Japan is picking itself up from the devastation of World War II and preparing to host the 1964 Olympics—and the mood is one of both optimism and conflict as the young generation struggles to throw off the shackles of a troubled past. Against this backdrop of hope and change, a friendship begins to blossom between high school students Umi and Shun—but a buried secret from their past emerges to cast a shadow on the future and pull them apart.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Animation","Drama"],"release_date":"2011-07-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mazqYfDUreT2KE6ZsaWT59JARHZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rRLYX4RZIyloHSJwvZKAhphAjiB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mazqYfDUreT2KE6ZsaWT59JARHZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rRLYX4RZIyloHSJwvZKAhphAjiB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":32600,"title":"Seven Chances","description":"Struggling stockbroker Jimmie Shannon learns that, if he gets married by 7 p.m. on his 27th birthday -- which is today -- he''ll inherit $7 million from an eccentric relative.","duration":"0:56:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1925-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jWID4Frs