ld romance with Bruce Wayne. At the same time, a mysterious figure begins to hunt down Gotham''s criminals, wrongly implicating Batman in the murders. Now on the run from the law, Batman must find and stop the culprit, while also navigating his relationship with Andrea.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Animation","Crime","Mystery"],"release_date":"1993-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cMUuAgVsMWOCawXonZ4D1dSMd6h.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hT4ehUteagUrhUOHAtmYiY7mp5l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cMUuAgVsMWOCawXonZ4D1dSMd6h.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hT4ehUteagUrhUOHAtmYiY7mp5l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9340,"title":"The Goonies","description":"Young teen Mikey Walsh and his friends set off on a quest to find Pirate One-Eyed Willie''s treasure in hopes of saving their homes from demolition. However, on their quest to find the treasure, they run into a family of recently escaped criminals, determined to capture the kids and reach the treasure first.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1985-06-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5qsyqA7FeYRymBmNbPBqBgqWPO4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eBU7gCjTCj9n2LTxvCSIXXOvHkD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5qsyqA7FeYRymBmNbPBqBgqWPO4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eBU7gCjTCj9n2LTxvCSIXXOvHkD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4550,"title":"Lady Vengeance","description":"Released after being wrongfully convicted and imprisoned for 13 years, a woman begins executing her elaborate plan of retribution.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2005-07-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1N45Z1UQY3LMNJEHuyHj6NygOYq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ifcxaKfzNQ6W8uSLpnGo7AfiSL8.j