ama","Music"],"release_date":"2000-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AqLtFRKVX2G0ghMnMnQoSGan4pY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3rrkyLYbgLj84AYvjhdcJot4JPx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AqLtFRKVX2G0ghMnMnQoSGan4pY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3rrkyLYbgLj84AYvjhdcJot4JPx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13413,"title":"BURN·E","description":"What lengths will a robot undergo to do his job? BURN·E is a dedicated hard working robot who finds himself locked out of his ship. BURN·E quickly learns that completing a simple task can often be a very difficult endeavor.","duration":"0:08:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2008-11-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gaLg3gpoJScDNfkDw4itX79Gi8x.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1wOReJq1vArLBSejND2Jbw0KeKh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gaLg3gpoJScDNfkDw4itX79Gi8x.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1wOReJq1vArLBSejND2Jbw0KeKh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10787,"title":"The Invisible Man","description":"After experimenting on himself and becoming invisible, scientist Jack Griffin, now aggressive due to the drug''s effects, seeks a way to reverse the experiment at any cost.","duration":"1:11:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1933-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uGXid3UHMzoL2hyNfWSPDWkqbKC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ejoVwGmEbTBrf78tqnTSO5g8iVz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uGXid3UHMzoL2hyNfWSPDWkqbKC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ejoVwGmEbTBrf78tqnTSO5g8iVz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":571,"title":"The Birds","description":"Thousands of birds flock into a seaside town and terrorize the residents in a series of deadly attacks.","