r","description":"Against formidable odds -- and an old-school diving instructor embittered by the U.S. Navy''s new, less prejudicial policies -- Carl Brashear sets his sights on becoming the Navy''s first African-American master diver in this uplifting true story. Their relationship starts out on the rocks, but fate ultimately conspires to bring the men together into a setting of mutual respect, triumph and honor.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2000-09-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/laNHiehbOHYM3y9FVFfqmLuX8X5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wNUAnXV1mzOOfvnVBIYsalkk078.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//laNHiehbOHYM3y9FVFfqmLuX8X5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wNUAnXV1mzOOfvnVBIYsalkk078.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10110,"title":"Empire of the Sun","description":"Jamie Graham, a privileged English boy, is living in Shanghai when the Japanese invade and force all foreigners into prison camps. Jamie is captured with an American sailor, who looks out for him while they are in the camp together. Even though he is separated from his parents and in a hostile environment, Jamie maintains his dignity and youthful spirit, providing a beacon of hope for the others held captive with him.","duration":"2:33:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1987-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xt7boIC763DdceVQIGJdnmKlDVu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gEaCzjwHoPgyQFcwHql7o5YLHAU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xt7boIC763DdceVQIGJdnmKlDVu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gEaCzjwHoPgyQFcwHql7o5YLHAU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6620,"title":"Sabrina","description":"After two years in Paris, chauffeur''s daughter Sabrina returns home elegantly transformed and immediately catches the attention of David, the playboy son of her father''s rich employers. David woos and wins Sabrina, who has always been in love with him, however their romance is threatened by David''s serious older brother Linus, who runs the family business and is relying on David to marry an heiress in order for a crucial merger to take place.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"1954-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3y8NgBIey8sivJAHaeIiyOnkDOz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e1Po9NDrH7IJZhv89467gJH5FS0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3y8NgBIey8sivJAHaeIiyOnkDOz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e1Po9NDrH7IJZhv89467gJH5FS0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5708,"title":"Control","description":"The story of Joy Division’s lead singer Ian Curtis, from his schoolboy days in 1973 to his suicide on the eve of the band''s first American tour in 1980.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dwxdn3ppDAn7QtaLlhGDEErWfg9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jOJiaOhwrDdwqTRZvZOhbndqHGp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dwxdn3ppDAn7QtaLlhGDEErWfg9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jOJiaOhwrDdwqTRZvZOhbndqHGp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3529,"title":"The Thin Man","description":"Former detective Nick Charles has retired from police work, preferring a life of cocktails, parties, and relaxation with his wealthy wife, Nora. Their holiday is interrupted when the daughter of Nick’s former client asks for help finding her missing father, eccentric inventor Clyde Wynant. When Wynant’s body is discovered, Nick is drawn back into the investigation, with Nora eagerly joining him. As the couple questions Wynant’s family, friends, and business associates, a tangled web of greed, deception, and murder begins to unravel.","duration":"1:31:00","genre"