c love that turns into a surreal vision of death, desire, and beauty.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"release_date":"1946-10-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2Ae0iV2HR3Raoras8G40MjBtJnn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iYSe3yrkma0e1B0wWPXgr8w5sDN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2Ae0iV2HR3Raoras8G40MjBtJnn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iYSe3yrkma0e1B0wWPXgr8w5sDN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":620,"title":"Ghostbusters","description":"After losing their university jobs, three parapsychologists start a ghost-catching business in New York City and uncover a supernatural threat that could destroy the world.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1984-06-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c6yfABGVKuB5cjoOwdX4AJMlzUz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7E8nLijS9AwwUEPu2oFYOVKhdFA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c6yfABGVKuB5cjoOwdX4AJMlzUz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7E8nLijS9AwwUEPu2oFYOVKhdFA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1190012,"title":"South Park: Joining the Panderverse","description":"Cartman''s deeply disturbing dreams portend the end of the life he knows and loves. Meanwhile, the adults in South Park are wrestling with their own life decisions, as the advent of AI is turning their world upside down.","duration":"0:49:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Science Fiction","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2023-10-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gIQ3AGPR6WAWzh70mulRDN8kd23.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/18IsRVfs5MkkTcqTGlUAnka6sCh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gIQ3AGPR6WAWzh70mulRDN8kd23.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//18IsRVfs5MkkTcqTGlUAnka6sCh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":744114,"title":"My Policeman","description":"In the late 1990s, the arrival of elderly invalid Patrick into Marion and Tom’s home triggers the exploration of seismic events from 40 years previous: the passionate relationship between Tom and Patrick at a time when homosexuality was illegal.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2022-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s5MLcxbdFqvIzTLNLU5yQFFYALR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wdbiMjXd4CxPfCx4r4Jfy8cGec0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s5MLcxbdFqvIzTLNLU5yQFFYALR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wdbiMjXd4CxPfCx4r4Jfy8cGec0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":132344,"title":"Before Midnight","description":"It has been nine years since we last met Jesse and Celine, the French-American couple who once met on a train in Vienna. They now live in Paris with twin daughters but have spent a summer in Greece at the invitation of an author colleague of Jesse''s. When the vacation is over and Jesse must send his teenage son off to the States, he begins to question his life decisions, and his relationship with Celine is at risk.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2013-04-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aPSGg0ZGirS0sSxGlwTGTAo0ruV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qbGKJmNUroDz75kh5Oafoall89e.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aPSGg0ZGirS0sSxGlwTGTAo0ruV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qbGKJmNUroDz75kh5Oafoall89e.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":966,"title":"The Magnificent Seven","description":"An oppressed Mexican peasant village hires seven gunfighters to help defend their homes.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Western"],"release_date":"1960-10-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/x0JQBBfK68gHm8rmyKk60bnnyw9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e5ToxOyJwuZD4VOfI0qEn5uIjeJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//x0JQBBfK68gHm8rmyKk60bnnyw9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e5ToxOyJwuZD4VOfI0qEn5uIjeJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":430,"title":"One, Two, Three","description":"In Cold War-era West Berlin, American Coca-Cola executive C.R. ''Mac'' MacNamara is tasked with playing babysitter to his boss'' spoiled 17-year-old daughter Scarlett, who proves more difficult than anticipated when she reveals that she is pregnant by a Communist.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1961-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4safDVSZx7a4I1TQoSyz6E1agzM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yWQE227ub1frfnjP5HZy0wLF0wu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4safDVSZx7a4I1TQoSyz6E1agzM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yWQE227ub1frfnjP5HZy0wLF0wu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":404604,"title":"Mom","description":"After her stepdaughter is sexually assaulted at a party, a furious mother sets out to destroy the lives of the four perpetrators who walked free.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"2017-07-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cCV4rIBtBjSDmAbP1SFaRz7CZV4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3aZhDbPRMPUZd2mCCeETnxZq1On.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cCV4rIBtBjSDmAbP1SFaRz7CZV4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3aZhDbPRMPUZd2mCCeETnxZq1On.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":350312,"title":"Bāhubali 2: The Conclusion","description":"When Mahendra, the son of Bāhubali, learns about his heritage, he begins to look for answers. His story is juxtaposed with past events that unfolded in the Mahishmati Kingdom.","duration":"2:47:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2017-04-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/whNjsTOUVg2lZLCKgGhnACnmV8E.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/21sC2assImQIYCEDA84Qh9d1RsK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//whNjsTOUVg2lZLCKgGhnACnmV8E.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//21sC2assImQIYCEDA84Qh9d1RsK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31216,"title":"I Can''t Think Straight","description":"Tala, a London-based Palestinian, is preparing for her elaborate Middle Eastern wedding when she meets Leyla, a young British Indian woman who is dating her best friend. Spirited Christian Tala and shy Muslim Leyla could not be more different from each other, but the attraction is immediate and goes deeper than friendship. But Tala is not ready to accept the implications of the choice her heart has made for her and escapes back to Jordan, while Leyla tries to move on with her new-found life, to the shock of her tradition-loving parents. As Tala''s wedding day approaches, simmering tensions come to boiling point and the pressure mounts for Tala to be true to herself.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/crUMmliCpduKqMKsAcT3tPx6e3H.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ePbH29RdMlz8mDEQyUkxRVcsB73.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//crUMmliCpduKqMKsAcT3tPx6e3H.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ePbH29RdMlz8mDEQyUkxRVcsB73.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":614409,"title":"To All the Boys: Always and Forever","description":"Senior year of high school takes center stage as Lara Jean returns from a family trip to Korea and considers her college plans — with and without Peter.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2021-02-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qjhcTGnjxYJqwBGlDzZkYWmne6e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_f