uction of a US submarine raises alarms for Admiral Tachibana. His estranged daughter Yuri investigates the legend of the guardian monsters, who must rise to protect Japan against the vengeful spirits within Godzilla that seek to destroy both the nation and its people for the suffering they inflicted in the Pacific conflict.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Horror","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2001-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/flIztIygNv3r3wgJCDyxfnvH70K.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d3lMCQJfjCBlGFy5sWpsEaBnEPl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//flIztIygNv3r3wgJCDyxfnvH70K.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d3lMCQJfjCBlGFy5sWpsEaBnEPl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31058,"title":"Bitter Rice","description":"Francesca and Walter are two-bit criminals in Northern Italy, and, in an effort to avoid the police, Francesca joins a group of women rice workers. She meets the voluptuous peasant rice worker, Silvana, and the soon-to-be-discharged soldier, Marco. Walter follows her to the rice fields, and the four characters become involved in a complex plot involving robbery, love, and murder.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1949-09-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1xbmwdaPBxXINV2KawDc1oQyJwa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9vvbZgbkfE7urqQXRNiONmvYTtF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1xbmwdaPBxXINV2KawDc1oQyJwa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9vvbZgbkfE7urqQXRNiONmvYTtF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1813,"title":"The Devil''s Advocate","description":"Aspiring Florida defense lawyer Kevin Lomax accepts a job at a New York law firm. With the stakes getting higher every case, Kevin quickly learns that his boss has something far more evil planned.","duration":"2:24:00","genre":["Horror","Drama","