r strongly disapprove of the match. When the Kirbys are invited to dinner to become better acquainted with their future in-laws, things don''t turn out the way Alice had hoped.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1938-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/As4GJO5V3SxbSDW8ZEWPnYtSZIg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9JltqbDyWstYW6gnvqDO6L5bOrx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//As4GJO5V3SxbSDW8ZEWPnYtSZIg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9JltqbDyWstYW6gnvqDO6L5bOrx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14615,"title":"Fury","description":"Joe, who owns a gas station along with his brothers and is about to marry Katherine, travels to the small town where she lives to visit her, but is wrongly mistaken for a wanted kidnapper and arrested.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1936-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nRBw8JYA3Li1d40kJN4AFMi5TT3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u1kjLTUqmqjDMlRxcwCqWagjf6r.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nRBw8JYA3Li1d40kJN4AFMi5TT3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u1kjLTUqmqjDMlRxcwCqWagjf6r.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9090,"title":"To Wong Foo, Thanks for Everything! Julie Newmar","description":"Veteran drag queens Vida Boheme and Noxeema Jackson take novice Chi-Chi Rodriguez under their wing on a madcap road trip across the country to compete in the Drag Queen of America pageant in Los Angeles.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1995-09-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xga9dXEIJHAjNLGMjw4VDPH7LJB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8bkJiI6N8wDxAtQ49bLUt0qCBII.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xga9dXEIJHAjNLGMjw4VDPH7LJB.jpg","small_poster_path":"htt