p_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Cxi5RQzYAlkNI5FROWkoKgiNkJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/54dlnGDexrwAFlDb8HWKfmmX4LB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Cxi5RQzYAlkNI5FROWkoKgiNkJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//54dlnGDexrwAFlDb8HWKfmmX4LB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25037,"title":"The Life and Death of Colonel Blimp","description":"General Candy, who''s overseeing an English squad in 1943, is a veteran leader who doesn''t have the respect of the men he''s training and is considered out-of-touch with what''s needed to win the war. But it wasn''t always this way. Flashing back to his early career in the Boer War and World War I, we see a dashing young officer whose life has been shaped by three different women, and by a lasting friendship with a German soldier.","duration":"2:43:00","genre":["War","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1943-07-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ojYxYkbO939H9OSayf5IKvbFA6i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kgyd5uyndsXiLYKlVgH0sm7Jfkv.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ojYxYkbO939H9OSayf5IKvbFA6i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kgyd5uyndsXiLYKlVgH0sm7Jfkv.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":17654,"title":"District 9","description":"Thirty years ago, aliens arrive on Earth. Not to conquer or give aid, but to find refuge from their dying planet. Separated from humans in a South African area called District 9, the aliens are managed by Multi-National United, which is unconcerned with the aliens'' welfare but will do anything to master their advanced technology. When a company field agent contracts a mysterious virus that begins to alter his DNA, there is only one place he can hide: District 9.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2009-08-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jhM3wgWUrrOkz9