lin to perform the main role in his new play. But there is a problem: Coquelin wants to premiere it at Christmas and Edmond has not written a single word.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Comedy","History"],"release_date":"2018-11-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/flqONlzGNUkGCJr9BfBhGNLYo6B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Y1VxSfJdu8fqQqgX0x6OObxvUw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//flqONlzGNUkGCJr9BfBhGNLYo6B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Y1VxSfJdu8fqQqgX0x6OObxvUw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":293863,"title":"The Age of Adaline","description":"After 29-year-old Adaline recovers from a nearly lethal accident, she inexplicably stops growing older. As the years stretch on and on, Adaline keeps her secret to herself  until she meets a man who changes her life.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Romance","Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"2015-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wTvDGO0xGMmnScqjuiDeWU7PkcB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3XFuCS6wBfpSnUQboLd1JtkJqe0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wTvDGO0xGMmnScqjuiDeWU7PkcB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3XFuCS6wBfpSnUQboLd1JtkJqe0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":284293,"title":"Still Alice","description":"Alice Howland, happily married with three grown children, is a renowned linguistics professor who starts to forget words. When she receives a devastating diagnosis, Alice and her family find their bonds tested.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qgCg1bCg9QBwr4jRygz6nZCoDqw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jJiGGbuLW8IkEnh5073maEmIr7V.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qgCg1bCg9QBwr4jRygz6nZCoDqw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jJiGGbuLW8IkEnh5073maEmIr7V.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24226,"title":"The Verdict","description":"Frank Galvin is a down-on-his-luck lawyer and reduced to drinking and ambulance chasing, when a former associate reminds him of his obligations in a medical malpractice suit by serving it to Galvin on a silver platter—all parties are willing to settle out of court. Blundering his way through the preliminaries, Galvin suddenly realizes that the case should actually go to court—to punish the guilty, to get a decent settlement for his clients... and to restore his standing as a lawyer.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1982-12-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sgsW7aqUXg4jG2GcoLKotSvp807.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iYEuFP1bpj5yOenKliiRFcNO3VE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sgsW7aqUXg4jG2GcoLKotSvp807.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iYEuFP1bpj5yOenKliiRFcNO3VE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":161,"title":"Ocean''s Eleven","description":"Less than 24 hours into his parole, charismatic thief Danny Ocean is already rolling out his next plan: In one night, Danny''s hand-picked crew of specialists will attempt to steal more than $150 million from three Las Vegas casinos. But to score the cash, Danny risks his chances of reconciling with ex-wife, Tess.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2001-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ncoqdHs1poUaBqyKic9YI8ai7MP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hQQCdZrsHtZyR6NbKH2YyCqd2fR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ncoqdHs1poUaBqyKic9YI8ai7MP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hQQCdZrsHtZyR6NbKH2YyCqd2fR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":780382,"title":"The Wolf and the Lion","description":"After her grandfather''s death, 20-year-old Alma decides to go back to her childhood home - a little isl