eir lives transporting several cases of dynamite (which is so old that it is dripping unstable nitroglycerin) across dangerous jungle terrain.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Thriller","Adventure"],"release_date":"1977-06-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g7prwSflNODkHZI6792MYoU4qoh.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2b7oexm173SF1FSEq0DdgxZZNRH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g7prwSflNODkHZI6792MYoU4qoh.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2b7oexm173SF1FSEq0DdgxZZNRH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38396,"title":"That''s Life","description":"While on the run from the police, an unlikely companionship blossoms between a funny con man who just broke out of jail, the bumbling cop whose car he seized at gunpoint, and a nitpicking civilian he unwittingly took hostage.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/WH9AZVrIXX3FiDyLb5S4Gv6YES.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zcZxzcl79S3gaWWDGGHcFkjT9m2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//WH9AZVrIXX3FiDyLb5S4Gv6YES.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zcZxzcl79S3gaWWDGGHcFkjT9m2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28569,"title":"Splendor in the Grass","description":"A fragile Kansas girl''s unrequited and forbidden love for a handsome young man from the town''s most powerful family drives her to heartbreak and madness.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1961-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3I5Dsam910xWbTEk69o04i8lVkC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n6Kw8Ui93SMhrk1MupCFwUg04vq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3I5Dsam910xWbTEk69o04i8lVkC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n6Kw8Ui93SMhrk1MupCFwUg04vq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9081,"title":"Waking Life","description":"Waking Life is about a young man in a persistent lucid dream-like state. The film follows its protagonist as he initially observes and later participates in philosophical discussions that weave together issues like reality, free will, our relationships with others, and the meaning of life.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2001-10-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/56MLZww2dMVAaTt5LDKCBu1do2X.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2MRM4PL6H7yraAkwyUEe2EqoQH3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//56MLZww2dMVAaTt5LDKCBu1do2X.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2MRM4PL6H7yraAkwyUEe2EqoQH3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3035,"title":"Frankenstein","description":"Obsessed scientist Dr. Henry Frankenstein attempts to create life by assembling a creature from deceased body parts. Aided by his loyal misshapen assistant, Fritz, Frankenstein succeeds in animating his monster, but it flees into the countryside and begins to wreak havoc.","duration":"1:10:00","genre":["Drama","Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1931-11-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wFbPbJ9uRDpjY7micBTeolgkOA4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mu6wHwH0IwCCaEYtpqujuPJYat1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wFbPbJ9uRDpjY7micBTeolgkOA4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mu6wHwH0IwCCaEYtpqujuPJYat1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":929204,"title":"Wallace & Gromit: Vengeance Most Fowl","description":"Gromit’s concern that Wallace is becoming too dependent on his inventions proves justified, when Wallace invents a “smart” gnome that seems to develop a mind of its own. When it emerges that a vengeful figure from the past might be masterminding things, it falls to Gromit to battle sinister forces and save his master… or Wallace may never be able to invent again!","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Comedy","Science Fiction","Family"],"release_date":"2024-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kO8auxMzNXrs4YqHdD08lefXIUV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jUWFSBxTOiCinPdTOh3IDUXVemZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kO8auxMzNXrs4YqHdD08lefXIUV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jUWFSBxTOiCinPdTOh3IDUXVemZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":401698,"title":"Hidden Kisses","description":"Nathan, 16, lives alone with his father Stephane. A newcomer in high school, he is invited to a party and falls in love with Louis, a boy in his class. They find themselves out of sight and kiss each other, but someone takes a picture of them. Soon, the photo is published on Facebook and a storm overtakes their lives as they face bullying and rejection.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2016-02-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3dzpw2dpLbB3goixNYJIB8jdaE1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1VixWTXYRLLBgmPuph80Qzcuffb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3dzpw2dpLbB3goixNYJIB8jdaE1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1VixWTXYRLLBgmPuph80Qzcuffb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":301528,"title":"Toy Story 4","description":"Woody has always been confident about his place in the world, devoted to taking care of his kid—whether that''s Andy or Bonnie. But after Bonnie creates a reluctant new toy called \"Forky\", a road trip adventure alongside old and new friends challenges everything Woody believes about loyalty, purpose, and what it truly means to be a toy.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-06-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q62bpQ67qaXY0u6b2wFEnQYIbPd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/