th, the astronauts work furiously with the ground crew to avert tragedy.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1995-06-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n0FDJI9c0uWiZwm8wgXVjaMBn96.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tVeKscCm2fY1xDXZk8PgnZ87h9S.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n0FDJI9c0uWiZwm8wgXVjaMBn96.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tVeKscCm2fY1xDXZk8PgnZ87h9S.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":187,"title":"Sin City","description":"Welcome to Sin City. This town beckons to the tough, the corrupt, the brokenhearted. Some call it dark… Hard-boiled. Then there are those who call it home — Crooked cops, sexy dames, desperate vigilantes. Some are seeking revenge, others lust after redemption, and then there are those hoping for a little of both. A universe of unlikely and reluctant heroes still trying to do the right thing in a city that refuses to care.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2005-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t9kQnqiaxQ8TLB25rTzDKLd0fdM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/i66G50wATMmPrvpP95f0XP6ZdVS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t9kQnqiaxQ8TLB25rTzDKLd0fdM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//i66G50wATMmPrvpP95f0XP6ZdVS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":503919,"title":"The Lighthouse","description":"Two lighthouse keepers try to maintain their sanity while living on a remote and mysterious New England island in the 1890s.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Thriller"],"release_date":"2019-10-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sYLzRuEcwSz0L1Z92wQNrETHU9O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dwXmOYJVM1VIkkSXHY5zYSaLJLC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sYLzRuEcwSz0L1Z92wQNrETHU9O.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dwXmOYJVM1VIkkSXHY5zYSaLJLC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":319373,"title":"Sweet Bean","description":"The master of a dorayaki pastry store hires a 76-year-old woman whose talents attract customers from all over. But she''s hiding a troubling secret. Life''s joys are found in the little details, and no matter what may be weighing you down, everyone loves a good pastry.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2015-05-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m2YuVWnbZH1pkxbBhNx4BR5F99n.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5YV0eoUBFQ4vKaN71SPtUte2YcD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m2YuVWnbZH1pkxbBhNx4BR5F99n.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5YV0eoUBFQ4vKaN71SPtUte2YcD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37472,"title":"Ip Man 2","description":"Having defeated the best fighters of the Imperial Japanese army in occupied Shanghai, Ip Man and his family settle in post-war Hong Kong. Struggling to make a living, Master Ip opens a kung fu school to bring his celebrated art of Wing Chun to the troubled youth of Hong Kong. His growing reputation soon brings challenges from powerful enemies, including pre-eminent Hung Gar master, Hung Quan.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Action","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-04-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lFhTEHBphkHw5hDsuRLYAXZB3u4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wMcyFfKcJneVgcHxWYiQNUNHUsq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lFhTEHBphkHw5hDsuRLYAXZB3u4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wMcyFfKcJneVgcHxWYiQNUNHUsq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20182,"title":"Alien Abduction: Incident in Lake County","description":"After a mysterious blackout, a son goes out to investigate and captures footage of actual aliens. When the aliens follow he and his brothers back to their home all hell breaks lose.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction","TV Movie"],"release_date":"1998-01-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gHsz9q4OXw4dBfh3aDvnCkKzsRb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ix6kUUS6UkbzzTb3gVzHk9QcNxY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gHsz9q4OXw4dBfh3aDvnCkKzsRb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ix6kUUS6UkbzzTb3gVzHk9QcNxY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1462322,"title":"The Last One for the Road","description":"A couple of jovial life-long drunkards run into a shy architecture undergrad, whose way of seeing things will be transformed as the trio wanders from pub to pub in search of a buried treasure.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2025-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/105dMBJGgkM0SzgjV62KzlMDdG8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b0oS5FReEJ3rhGzGKY16Qz0Q7w1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//105dMBJGgkM0SzgjV62KzlMDdG8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b0oS5FReEJ3rhGzGKY16Qz0Q7w1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":916405,"title":"The Quiet Girl","description":"A quiet, neglected girl is sent away from her dysfunctional family to live with relatives for the summer. She blossoms in their care, but in this house where there are meant to be no secrets, she discovers one.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2022-05-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/23jok5sYloPEBwKd6Bp4V8Y1O9I.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6Njyz53N417cgxE0d7cBEWHUEjc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//23jok5sYloPEBwKd6Bp4V8Y1O9I.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6Njyz53N417cgxE0d7cBEWHUEjc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9454,"title":"EverAfter","description":"Danielle, a vibrant young woman, was forced into servitude after the death of her father when she was a young girl. Danielle''s stepmother, Rodmilla, is a heartless woman who forces Danielle to do the cooking and cleaning, while she tries to marry off the eldest of her two daughters to the prince. But Danielle''s life takes a wonderful turn when, under the guise of a visiting royal, she meets the charming Prince Henry.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1998-07-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lhpokM60CnLWcNETQqKMz2q9ryL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9TspO5dThMBioF0DFrvy6YqrngH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lhpokM60CnLWcNETQqKMz2q9ryL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9TspO5dThMBioF0DFrvy6YqrngH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8055,"title":"The Reader","description":"The story of Michael Berg, a German lawyer who, as a teenager in the late 1950s, had an affair with an older woman, Hanna, who then disappeared only to resurface years later as one of the defendants in a war crimes trial stemming from her actions as a concentration camp guard late in the war. He alone realizes that Hanna is illiterate and may be concealing that fact at the expense of her freedom.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2008-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/waMGsUEoHfYj3A1uRMUUgpBa71d.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r0WURbmnhgKeBpHcpDULBgRedQM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//waMGsUEoHfYj3A1uRMUUgpBa71d.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r0WURbmnhgKeBpHcpDULBgRedQM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1902,"title":"Open Your Eyes","description":"Handsome 25-year-old Cesar had it all -- a successful career, expensive cars, a swank bachelor''s pad, and an endless string of beautiful and willing women -- until he is thrown into a strange psychological mystery after a car accident scars his face and lands him in prison.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1997-12-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k6xQZq2jkA7xRpvyy2kLWprFwIN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1NkQNM5bw3U7n3RCba8JKnb61Ds.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k6xQZq2jkA7xRpvyy2kLWprFwIN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1NkQNM5bw3U7n3RCba8JKnb61Ds.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":898,"title":"Birdman of Alcatraz","description":"After killing a prison guard, convict Robert Stroud faces life imprisonment in solitary confinement. Driven nearly mad by loneliness and despair, Stroud''s life gains new meaning when he happens upon a helpless baby sparrow in the exercise yard and nurses it back to health. Despite having only a third grade education, Stroud goes on to become a renowned ornithologist and achieves a greater sense of freedom and purpose behind bars than most people find in the outside world.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","History"],"release_date":"1962-07-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1J6QXImtqIQxiOdVTonLV5IbRwA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6EODLN11HTX4l2cmakAhWIoJLF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1J6QXImtqIQxiOdVTonLV5IbRwA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6EODLN11HTX4l2cmakAhWIoJLF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1228710,"title":"The Mandalorian and Grogu","description":"The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin and his young apprentice Grogu.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2026-05-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ysL