ed man, and a child hostage and force them to drive them outside Rome to help them make a clean getaway.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"1995-11-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2htKwdsvkEPgAMGgwqERaQOXM0f.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/coPfiRtfFvbEOJra64hnlXMsY8w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2htKwdsvkEPgAMGgwqERaQOXM0f.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//coPfiRtfFvbEOJra64hnlXMsY8w.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10604,"title":"Zorba the Greek","description":"An uptight English writer traveling to Crete on a matter of business finds his life changed forever when he meets the gregarious Alexis Zorba.","duration":"2:22:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1964-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fdKE05kO9lch613DR2rfIqbv7dN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jAYOY38TRDprIgu7vgES0FFJJSl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fdKE05kO9lch613DR2rfIqbv7dN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jAYOY38TRDprIgu7vgES0FFJJSl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":566451,"title":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- The Frozen Bond","description":"A prequel story set seven years before the beginning of the Re:ZERO series. Emilia lives in a secluded forest covered in snow with the spirit Puck. The forest holds a secret: the elves who once lived there have been frozen into ice. Emilia is feared by the people living on the outskirts of the forest, but makes a humble living selling magic stones and warding off Magic Beasts. One day, however, her peaceful life is disrupted when the Great Spirit of Fire Melakuera decides to lay his judgment upon her.","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2019-11-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9K1zhrS8jZ3NFZwzc5RgtwxskLT.jpg","poster_path":"https