en Came You","description":"An American hypochondriac who is working as a baggage handler is forced to confront his fears when a British teenager with a terminal illness enlists him to help her carry out her eccentric bucket list.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9oI4ImMclu3l0OHaK7o9eELfL3l.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/658QP5tmBRUlE5JvxOnnmITfG1F.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9oI4ImMclu3l0OHaK7o9eELfL3l.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//658QP5tmBRUlE5JvxOnnmITfG1F.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16619,"title":"Ordinary People","description":"Beth, Calvin, and their son Conrad are living in the aftermath of the death of the other son. Conrad is overcome by grief and misplaced guilt to the extent of a suicide attempt. He is in therapy. Beth had always preferred his brother and is having difficulty being supportive to Conrad. Calvin is trapped between the two trying to hold the family together.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1980-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/81LV5HJ9nUXGCMhrJpFNjwvbEZl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5gQLGRmBV8XoqWgkxuRFwe3jZV7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//81LV5HJ9nUXGCMhrJpFNjwvbEZl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5gQLGRmBV8XoqWgkxuRFwe3jZV7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13004,"title":"Barbie and the Diamond Castle","description":"Liana and Alexa are best friends who share everything, including their love of singing. Upon meeting a girl inside a mirror, the duo embark on a journey that will put their friendship to the ultimate test.","duration":"1:18:00","genre":["Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2008-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qhc9m6lg6ia8fKk7Y1mxFntjYYv.jpg","poster_path":"https