curity expert becomes a whistleblower after uncovering secrets about aliens, putting him on the run from a corporation. Meanwhile, a meteorologist experiencing strange phenomena joins forces with him to prove there''s life beyond our understanding.","duration":"2:26:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Thriller"],"release_date":"2026-06-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1e0KDRYKRPHiVNj8yQKYuU2jVyQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1e0KDRYKRPHiVNj8yQKYuU2jVyQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":129670,"title":"Nebraska","description":"An aging, booze-addled father takes a trip from Montana to Nebraska with his estranged son in order to claim what he believes to be a million-dollar sweepstakes prize.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"2013-09-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yePsFcldyZ6VnxaBr8ZbVEaOt4W.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o1t2Mw18EEBnl8v4Nby3PFjxnM1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yePsFcldyZ6VnxaBr8ZbVEaOt4W.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//o1t2Mw18EEBnl8v4Nby3PFjxnM1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":43231,"title":"White Nights","description":"A middle-aged man meets a young woman who is waiting on a canal bridge for her lover''s return.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1957-11-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fWkNhudvl6dtEHWSdQD6nl92GnD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sAFR7LbXnPSjZGpG1ihSAN7vrfR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fWkNhudvl6dtEHWSdQD6nl92GnD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sAFR7LbXnPSjZGpG1ihSAN7vrfR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38580,"title":"The Little Matchgirl","description":"An animated short based on Hans Christian Andersen''s tale about a poor young girl with a burning desire to find comfort and happiness in her life. Desperate to keep warm, the girl lights the matches she sells, and envisions a very different life for herself in the fiery flames filled with images of loving relatives, bountiful food, and a place to call home.","duration":"0:07:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2006-09-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dcGTfPk5NYqDmCP01ddzwl5m2V1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/GmeFUrGNdbXbWWjd78iDCmE4Ec.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dcGTfPk5NYqDmCP01ddzwl5m2V1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//GmeFUrGNdbXbWWjd78iDCmE4Ec.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28205,"title":"The Class","description":"An average guy of an Estonian high-school decides to defend his bullied classmate. This starts a war between him and the informal leader of the class.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2007-03-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w072p8uyKx0SYP55PBTCRrFqqOP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AogHMwGObAqXgXoqtj2Zg90fX5K.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w072p8uyKx0SYP55PBTCRrFqqOP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AogHMwGObAqXgXoqtj2Zg90fX5K.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9075,"title":"Black Book","description":"Israel, 1956: Jewish teacher Rachel Stein rather unexpectedly meets an old friend at the kibbutz. It brings back memories of her experiences in the Netherlands during the war, memories of betrayal. In September 1944, Rachel''s hiding place is bombed by Allied troops; she makes contact with a resistance member and joins a group of Jews to be smuggled across the Biesbosch to the freed South Netherlands. Only Rachel escapes a massacre by patrol Germans, and is rescued by a resistance group under the leadership of Gerben Kuipers, whose son is captured trying to smuggle weapons. Kuipers asks Rachel to seduce SS-hauptsturmführer Ludwig Müntze, a mission that she will soon learn that the boat attack wasn''t a coincidence.","duration":"2:25:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","War"],"release_date":"2006-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vT39NcxIWHL5XVNQGRMbS8NxXs0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vZaYDWa3IqTNKsHCsUr72J4zTJ6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vT39NcxIWHL5XVNQGRMbS8NxXs0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vZaYDWa3IqTNKsHCsUr72J4zTJ6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6114,"title":"Bram Stoker''s Dracula","description":"Count Dracula, a 15th-century prince, is condemned to live off the blood of the living for eternity. Young lawyer Jonathan Harker is sent to Dracula''s castle to finalise a land deal, but when the Count sees a photo of Harker''s fiancée, Mina, the spitting image of his dead wife, he imprisons him and sets off for London to track her down.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Romance","Horror"],"release_date":"1992-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fGuhbAlDpvmNuC0vkz1vsIzYwsq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wpRrdm6g8zWtJnzVqME5QwSKkn7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fGuhbAlDpvmNuC0vkz1vsIzYwsq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wpRrdm6g8zWtJnzVqME5QwSKkn7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4593,"title":"The Discreet Charm of the Bourgeoisie","description":"In Luis Buñuel’s deliciously satiric masterpiece, an upper-class sextet sits down to dinner but never eats, their attempts continually thwarted by a vaudevillian mixture of events both actual and imagined.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1972-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z6NI6n5Mv