nd in history! In the face of incredible odds, Olivia, Stella, Wen, Mohini and Charlie find they can make a real difference when they learn to lean on each other and let go of everything holding back their dreams.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Music","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2011-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lBy0tIjlc3rAy4dih74RFDIpxoP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Tbbxf38c16kbfezmXkPYS2tYRN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lBy0tIjlc3rAy4dih74RFDIpxoP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Tbbxf38c16kbfezmXkPYS2tYRN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":53023,"title":"Happiness","description":"Though married to the good-natured, beautiful Thérèse, young husband and father François finds himself falling unquestioningly into an affair with an attractive postal worker. One of Agnès Varda''s most provocative films, ''Le bonheur'' examines, with a deceptively cheery palette and the spirited strains of Mozart, the ideas of fidelity and happiness in a modern, self-centered world.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1965-02-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wPliKFiYaUEYCWWIIFW9mxjiz0G.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nNW4ewpsqxEQQoHXv4PAUsFuDmd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wPliKFiYaUEYCWWIIFW9mxjiz0G.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nNW4ewpsqxEQQoHXv4PAUsFuDmd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13403,"title":"Hedwig and the Angry Inch","description":"Raised a boy in East Berlin, Hedwig undergoes a personal transformation in order to emigrate to the U.S., where she reinvents herself as an ''internationally ignored'' but divinely talented rock diva, inhabiting a ''beautiful gender of one''.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Comedy","Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2001-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uY5EB9VIX8lT03MdYcR9DzlhEGM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jafIFAW8sHQkzWPGoMDR4892dFI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uY5EB9VIX8lT03MdYcR9DzlhEGM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jafIFAW8sHQkzWPGoMDR4892dFI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2503,"title":"The Bourne Ultimatum","description":"Bourne is brought out of hiding once again by reporter Simon Ross who is trying to unveil Operation Blackbriar, an upgrade to Project Treadstone, in a series of newspaper columns. Information from the reporter stirs a new set of memories, and Bourne must finally uncover his dark past while dodging The Company''s best efforts to eradicate him.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2007-08-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qiBILuWhv7ipF0pxiEqIJdkQzj8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/15rMz5MRXFp7CP4VxhjYw4y0FUn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qiBILuWhv7ipF0pxiEqIJdkQzj8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//15rMz5MRXFp7CP4VxhjYw4y0FUn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":434616,"title":"Patients","description":"After a serious sport accident in a swimming pool, Ben, now an incomplete quadriplegic, arrives in a rehabilitation center. He meets with other handicapped persons (tetraplegics, paraplegics, traumatized crania), all victims of accidents, as well as a handicapped since his early childhood. They go through impotence, despair and resignation, with their daily struggle to learn how to move a finger or to hold a fork. Some of them slowly find a little mobility while others receive the verdict of the handicap for life. Despite everything, hope and friendship help them endure their difficulties.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-03-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ls3wjiOmWk8FAcf