s threatened when their eldest son falls in love with a girl, and announces his wish to live his life on his own terms.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Crime"],"release_date":"1988-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xZGCJleQaeqi5jFsvcOoqfsMZvT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kzhyruFxY4Z5Ert8M9tuM2MV8dd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xZGCJleQaeqi5jFsvcOoqfsMZvT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kzhyruFxY4Z5Ert8M9tuM2MV8dd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11704,"title":"The Secret of NIMH","description":"A widowed field mouse must move her family -- including an ailing son -- to escape a farmer''s plow. Aided by a crow and a pack of superintelligent, escaped lab rats, the brave mother struggles to transplant her home to firmer ground.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Drama","Family","Fantasy","Mystery","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1982-06-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zhw2gjDMedftoaoPeQYertgTAo2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/prNrnOKlkV9wl5Sl3zwHu1f3t2z.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zhw2gjDMedftoaoPeQYertgTAo2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//prNrnOKlkV9wl5Sl3zwHu1f3t2z.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11167,"title":"Peeping Tom","description":"Loner Mark Lewis works at a film studio during the day and, at night, takes racy photographs of women. Also he''s making a documentary on fear, which involves recording the reactions of victims as he murders them. He befriends Helen, the daughter of the family living in the apartment below his, and he tells her vaguely about the movie he is making.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Thriller","Horror"],"release_date":"1960-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rLm66DbLwxHeRB34oJ1mhsu0urc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w6