d island of Corto Maltese.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-07-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jlGmlFOcfo8n5tURmhC7YVd4Iyy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q61qEyssk2ku3okWICKArlAdhBn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jlGmlFOcfo8n5tURmhC7YVd4Iyy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q61qEyssk2ku3okWICKArlAdhBn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":36685,"title":"The Rocky Horror Picture Show","description":"After getting a flat tire in the middle of nowhere, newly engaged couple Brad and Janet encounter the eerie mansion of the flamboyant, seductive Dr Frank-N-Furter and a variety of eccentric characters. Through elaborate dance and rock music, the mad scientist unveils his latest creation: a perfect, muscular man.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy","Science Fiction","Horror"],"release_date":"1975-08-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/54aVU7tnvDKkX6ibzFg6ke03BV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3pyE6ZqDbuJi7zrNzzQzcKTWdmN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//54aVU7tnvDKkX6ibzFg6ke03BV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3pyE6ZqDbuJi7zrNzzQzcKTWdmN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20677,"title":"Detective Conan: Captured in Her Eyes","description":"Police officers around Tokyo are being murdered by an unknown assailant. When Ran witnesses an attempt on the life of one of her friends in the police, she loses her memory. Now, Conan and Inspector Megure must find the murderer while Ran attempts to regain her lost memories.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Animation","Crime","Drama","Mystery","Adventure"],"release_date":"2000-04-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wHJrerp9snJtRSYhDRmjZhtgwYq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/o0ta1yBaKQRjEWLhOU8jmE9TdGa.jpg","small_backd