arter, a boxer wrongly imprisoned for murder, and the people who aided in his fight to prove his innocence.","duration":"2:26:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1999-09-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ffAL7ZiUnCay51SeHFTrTEUpUkO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zhnxjsNnnpsBMF5V1H7Pzkec45Y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ffAL7ZiUnCay51SeHFTrTEUpUkO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zhnxjsNnnpsBMF5V1H7Pzkec45Y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8741,"title":"The Thin Red Line","description":"The story of a group of men, an Army Rifle company called C-for-Charlie, who change, suffer, and ultimately make essential discoveries about themselves during the fierce World War II battle of Guadalcanal. It follows their journey, from the surprise of an unopposed landing, through the bloody and exhausting battles that follow, to the ultimate departure of those who survived.","duration":"2:51:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1998-12-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hsDyfAk2ml82IrpPC4AHvxvuTsn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/seMydAaoxQP6F0xbE1jOcTmn5Jr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hsDyfAk2ml82IrpPC4AHvxvuTsn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//seMydAaoxQP6F0xbE1jOcTmn5Jr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":114,"title":"Pretty Woman","description":"Vivian is a carefree, streetwise diamond in the rough when she meets sophisticated billionaire Edward in a chance encounter that turns into a week-long business arrangement. But Vivian''s energetic spirit challenges Edward''s no-nonsense approach to life, and soon they are teaching each other – and falling in love!","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Romance","Comedy"],"release_date":"1990-03-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rleTwPqymtOpeD2bR7asJGEmldV.jpg","poster_path":"https://