ed by Bing Crosby.","duration":"0:37:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Horror","Comedy"],"release_date":"1949-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tZtawSPJIMCjXOJrUHOlOjJQf5e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6bt8qmhxVsgbxFLQCoAcekdCFiw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tZtawSPJIMCjXOJrUHOlOjJQf5e.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6bt8qmhxVsgbxFLQCoAcekdCFiw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26280,"title":"I Killed My Mother","description":"Hubert, a brash 17-year-old, is confused and torn by a love-hate relationship with his mother that consumes him more and more each day. After distressing ordeals and tragic episodes, Hubert will find his mother on the banks of Saint Lawrence river, where he grew up, and where a murder will be committed: the murder of childhood.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2009-06-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/72G2cjD0sVmpkQqFkSmADUz0g5s.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nB6OuDdERS95aQtoxPExXxsW3Ov.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//72G2cjD0sVmpkQqFkSmADUz0g5s.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nB6OuDdERS95aQtoxPExXxsW3Ov.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":891636,"title":"Fireworks","description":"The troubled relationship between Gianni and Nino, set in the narrow-minded and prejudicial Sicily of 1982.","duration":"2:14:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2023-03-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kYD3ykZjiqFzJPhPLEAQ1QUj90x.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7nCjnXsLsN44rUIm4eEH9HEhuTk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kYD3ykZjiqFzJPhPLEAQ1QUj90x.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7nCjnXsLsN44rUIm4eEH9HEhuTk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":457601,"title":"Everything You Want","description":"An aimless young troublemaker, Alessandro, squanders his days gambling and getting into fights, and he often spends his nights in jail. With few prospects, he begrudgingly accepts a job as a companion to Giorgio, an elderly poet suffering from Alzheimer’s. On their daily walks, the two banter and become friends, and Alessandro quickly learns more about this forgotten poet as the old man’s memory drifts. After learning a secret from Giorgio’s past, Alessandro and his friends work to uncover the mystery of this tale, an unexpected history lesson and a touching coming-of-age adventure.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ngZXl98oeifZWiQAcmaItboEx6t.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1FOuI1i7jWb4MNfPgIERrsUGYrM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ngZXl98oeifZWiQAcmaItboEx6t.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1FOuI1i7jWb4MNfPgIERrsUGYrM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":407445,"title":"Breathe","description":"Based on the true story of Robin, a handsome, brilliant and adventurous man whose life takes a dramatic turn when polio leaves him paralyzed.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2017-10-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/quVfDYktBYQfojgZ3E9pYrclGse.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wLu2N0QVfSpk10RJ17HLHyRUmww.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//quVfDYktBYQfojgZ3E9pYrclGse.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wLu2N0QVfSpk10RJ17HLHyRUmww.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":217993,"title":"Justice League: War","description":"The world is under attack by an alien armada led by the powerful Apokoliptian, Darkseid. A group of superheroes consisting of Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, The Flash, Green Lantern, Cyborg, and Shazam must set aside their differences and gather together to defend Earth.","duration":"1:19:00",