.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lV5OpzAss1z06YNagOVap1I35mH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11202,"title":"Patton","description":"\"Patton\" tells the tale of General George S. Patton, famous tank commander of World War II. The film begins with Patton''s career in North Africa and progresses through the invasion of Germany and the fall of the Third Reich. Side plots also speak of Patton''s numerous faults such his temper and habit towards insubordination.","duration":"2:52:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1970-01-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/txXPooNu7fr4YhLwx7AlXkU0PnN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rLM7jIEPTjj4CF7F1IrzzNjLUCu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//txXPooNu7fr4YhLwx7AlXkU0PnN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rLM7jIEPTjj4CF7F1IrzzNjLUCu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":4024,"title":"Last Year at Marienbad","description":"At a weekend gathering, a man tells a woman that they had spent time there together a year prior. But, the woman has no recollection whatsoever and is convinced that he is simply fabricating the encounter. The more he speaks about their activities the previous year however, the more compelling he becomes. The question remains however – did they meet previously or not?","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1961-09-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/h1ov8VcVCiZsnWRu4EjZ74R33GP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/syIJCqiSkGRJTlyaBtyI5jqPtE7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//h1ov8VcVCiZsnWRu4EjZ74R33GP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//syIJCqiSkGRJTlyaBtyI5jqPtE7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1923,"title":"Twin Peaks: Fire Walk with Me","description":"In the questionable town of Deer Meadow, Washington, FBI Agent Desmond inexplicably disappears while hunting for the man who murdered a teen girl. The killer is never apprehended, and, after experiencing dark visions and supernatural encounters, Agent Dale Cooper chillingly predicts that the culprit will claim another life. Meanwhile, in the more cozy town of Twin Peaks, hedonistic beauty Laura Palmer hangs with lowlifes and seems destined for a grisly fate.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","Mystery","Horror"],"release_date":"1992-06-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/amGU1FpELmenVvNmPShW58Orepy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mxsGXqetGnirf99qapYd5MMY1VL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//amGU1FpELmenVvNmPShW58Orepy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mxsGXqetGnirf99qapYd5MMY1VL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":175,"title":"The Big Blue","description":"Childhood friends Jacques and Enzo share a passion for the danger of free diving. Jacques, following in the footsteps of his father, who died at sea when Jacques was a boy, harbors a remarkable ability to adjust his heart rate and breathing patterns in the water, with his vital signs more closely resembling those of dolphins than men.","duration":"2:48:00","genre":["Romance","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"1988-05-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1J28PJOkusMN5Ab9Q3oF310e11k.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3t5t7yaFiTJQlqxiTkXJMFZdkh3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1J28PJOkusMN5Ab9Q3oF310e11k.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3t5t7yaFiTJQlqxiTkXJMFZdkh3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":614934,"title":"Elvis","description":"The life story of Elvis Presley as seen through the complicated relationship with his enigmatic manager, Colonel Tom Parker.","duration":"2:39:00","genre":["Music","History","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rLo9T9jEg67UZPq3midjLnTUYYi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w60