/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sxLRt2u5xgUgkrIAPyE0KiiSVnX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bW9fKeoIbq4bDclZ4h9D5BqSqmX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sxLRt2u5xgUgkrIAPyE0KiiSVnX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11327,"title":"Midnight Express","description":"Billy Hayes is caught attempting to smuggle drugs out of a country. The courts decide to make an example of him, sentencing him to more than 30 years in prison. Hayes has two opportunities for release: the appeals made by his lawyer, his family, and the American government, or the \"Midnight Express\".","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1978-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f4dcx5U9X3w27e8iithmsaohF5t.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mIzGfVCSWmmYjLIIbA2BX3rlV56.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f4dcx5U9X3w27e8iithmsaohF5t.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mIzGfVCSWmmYjLIIbA2BX3rlV56.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11236,"title":"The Secret Garden","description":"A young British girl born and reared in India loses her neglectful parents in an earthquake. She is returned to England to live at her uncle''s castle. Her uncle is very distant due to the loss of his wife ten years before. Neglected once again, she begins exploring the estate and discovers a garden that has been locked and forgotten. Aided by one of the servants'' boys, she begins restoring the garden, and eventually discovers some other secrets of the manor.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1993-08-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8s7FJ9dHXgeFZdvxfjPmrrJh6EC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zf6h5dJ7wVG7LqMO9dhHGHVejzj.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8s7FJ9dHXgeFZdvxfjPmrrJh6EC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zf6h5dJ7wVG7LqMO9dhHGHVejzj.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5781,"title":"That Obscure Object of Desire","description":"After dumping a bucket of water on a beautiful young woman from the window of a train car, wealthy Frenchman Mathieu, regales his fellow passengers with the story of the dysfunctional relationship between himself and the young woman in question, a fiery 19-year-old flamenco dancer named Conchita. What follows is a tale of cruelty, depravity and lies -- the very building blocks of love.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1977-08-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/79ofDLTW1ozMSYDNWhDYe5cQzAa.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9iUdC4dftkjYSBUJq5DAxC6WqB9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//79ofDLTW1ozMSYDNWhDYe5cQzAa.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9iUdC4dftkjYSBUJq5DAxC6WqB9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":747059,"title":"Burrow","description":"A young rabbit embarks on a journey to dig the burrow of her dreams, despite not having a clue what she''s doing. Rather than reveal to her neighbors her imperfections, she digs herself deeper and deeper into trouble. After hitting (bed)rock bottom, she learns there is no shame in asking for help.","duration":"0:06:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tj58v7h4d9xDkFr3Hot0qhKdwRf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zkQcHvMc7gVG6OWVotVLDeRkrRl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tj58v7h4d9xDkFr3Hot0qhKdwRf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zkQcHvMc7gVG6OWVotVLDeRkrRl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":529203,"title":"The Croods: A New Age","description":"Searching for a safer habitat, the prehistoric Crood family discovers an idyllic, walled-in paradise that meets all of its needs. Unfortunately, they must also learn to live with the Bettermans -- a family that''s a couple of steps above the Croods on the evolutionary ladder. As tensions between the new neighbors start to rise, a new threat soon propels both clans on an epic adventure that forces them to embrace their differences, draw strength from one another, and survive together.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Adventure","Fantasy","Comedy"],"release_date":"2020-11-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ytTQoYkdpsgtfDWrNFCei8Mfbxu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tbVZ3Sq88dZaCANlUcewQuHQOaE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ytTQoYkdpsgtfDWrNFCei8Mfbxu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tbVZ3Sq88dZaCANlUcewQuHQOaE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11030,"title":"Zelig","description":"Fictional documentary about the life of human chameleon Leonard Zelig, a man who becomes a celebrity in the 1920s due to his ability to look and act like whoever is around him. Clever editing places Zelig in real newsreel footage of Woodrow Wilson, Babe Ruth, and others.","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1983-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oCC3rSccbJV9bxMDRedtqI6pnla.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bfs67JaV4B5xVBvtXd3O4R7nk9G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oCC3rSccbJV9bxMDRedtqI6pnla.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bfs67JaV4B5xVBvtXd3O4R7nk9G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":629028,"title":"Mission: Possible","description":"Chinese secret agent Da-hee receives intel that a large number of illegal firearms are being smuggled into Korea and is sent to investigate the case. She meets Su-han, who is supposed to help her with the case, but due to his lackluster skills they fight over trivial things. But as their witnesses are suddenly murdered, the two of them quickly become the prime suspects.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Comedy","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2021-02-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1Btw3PPFMPbVxHeSuad72vqbYVk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/l2VrjVMJvyYizizmTkro22GLLnt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1Btw3PPFMPbVxHeSuad72vqbYVk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//l2VrjVMJvyYizizmTkro22GLLnt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":497106,"title":"All About Me","description":"Dramatised origin story of one of Germany''s most beloved contemporary comedians, Hape Kerkeling.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2018-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AvXD91RMtQMXzsbhrOzO2xz690o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3aWmV76RZqhuGW7Eln1ShdUhOwc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AvXD91RMtQMXzsbhrOzO2xz690o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3aWmV76RZqhuGW7Eln1ShdUhOwc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":194662,"title":"Birdman or (The Unexpected Virtue of Ignorance)","description":"A fading actor best known for his portrayal of a popular superhero attempts to mount a comeback by appearing in a Broadway play. As opening night approaches, his attempts to become more altruistic, rebuild his career, and reconnect with friends and family prove more difficult than expected.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/s0OrExdg7i3RLR7oqzHRk4q2kL4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rHUg2AuIuLSIYMYFgavVwqt1jtc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//s0OrExdg7i3RLR7oqzHRk4q2kL4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rHUg2AuIuLSIYMYFgavVwqt1jtc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1391,"title":"Y Tu Mamá También","description":"In Mexico, two teenage boys and an attractive older woman embark on a road trip and learn a thing 